<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">Tutsa: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Joon</para>
  <para style="toc1">JOON ih raang arah Ruurangese</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jn</para>
  <para style="mt">JOON</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ih Raang Arah Ruurangese</para>
  <para style="imt">Ephangjatjih</para>
  <para style="ip">Ruurangese tiit Joon ih raangha langla, Jisu ah mabah uh lathoonka Rangte Jengkhaap, “Heteewah mina eh hoon ra haano seng damdi waktong taha.” A leedap adi baat hali, Jisu ah thoomhoon kakhat jun ih seng khopi theng, Rangte sah, heh suh hanpiite loong ah ih lathoon roidong choh ah.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ephangjat etheng ah langla lathoon theng Rangte Jengkhaap ah Jisu taang ni jeela, arah leedap ah phang weh eno Jisu ih paatjaajih reeta loong ah japtup hi, eno seng ih erah dowa ih jat hi Jisu ah seng khopi theng Rangte sah. Leedap ah weh eno jat hi mih paatjaajih ah mamah ih reeraangta. Arah leedap adi marah marah ni baat hali Jisu ah tuprum ano miloong ah ih mamah ih hanpi rumta, rukho loong ah ih taboichaatta. A leedaap asih ejom dowa ih asih sinat ni japtup hi, heh jootkhak rangja heliphante loong damdi mamah ih roomtongta, heh teewah tekja mamah etheng ah erah chaankot jengkhaap ah banbaat ih rumta. Leedaap ethoon ni baat ha, Jisu mamah ih jokhakta, mamah ih siiwiita, bangphak ni mamah ih rapbotta, adoleh ngaaksaat lidi heliphante loong damdi mamah ih chomuita.</para>
  <para style="ip">Minuh wasiit miwah damdi roomjup arah japjoot khiikkhi ah (8:1-11) maramarah leedap ni kook hoom eha tiimnge liidi ehakdi raangta leedap adi takapta, maramarah leedap adi ah kap eha.</para>
  <para style="ip">Joon ih adi lathoon theng roidong ah Jisu jun ih kot tiit ah baat ha, erah roidong ah amadi phangkoh hali eno Jisu juuba lampo, amiisak, nyia roidong ngeh ih thaangchaatte loong asuh koh ah. Joon ih chiilam laalam ni ju, phaksat, rangwu, shaapriimte nyia hesaapsah adoleh anggut bang nyia hetiik loong ah tiim likhiik ah erah ah nyootbaat ha.</para>
  <para style="iot">Hemong Dowa Jatjih</para>
  <para style="io1">Ephangjatjih<char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Juutemte Joon nyia Jisu liphante jaakhoh dowa loong ah <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 1:19-51">1:19-51</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nokraat ni Jisu mootkaat <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 2:1-12:50">2:1—12:50</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lithoon ni Jerusalem reeni Jisu mootkaat <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 13:1-19:42">13:1—19:42</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Teesu we ngaaksaat ano dongkhoom tiit <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 20:1-31">20:1-31</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jengkhaap thoonjeng: Galili ni we dongkhoom tiit <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 21:1-25">21:1-25</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Roidong jengkhaap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mongrep maang dongsiitka di, Rangte Jengkhaap ah eje angta; heh Rangte damdi angta, eno Jengkhaap ah Rangte angta. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ephangdong dowa ih Jengkhaap ah Rangte damdi angta. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Rangte ih jirep ah heh jun ih dongsiitta; jaatrep dongsiitta dowa esiit taan uh heh jun ih ladongka rah tajeeka. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Jengkhaap ah roidong choh lampo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jengkhaap ah roidong choh lampo; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh</char><char style="fq" closed="false">marah dongsiita erah Jengkhaap jun ih roidong eje angta.</char></note> angta, eno roidong erah ih mina raangtaan ih weephaak thukta. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Weephaak ah rangnak khoni phaakta, eno rangnak ih erah weephaak ah mabah uh tajen met siitta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:1">Mat 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mk 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-2">Luk 3:1-2</ref></char>
    </note> Rangte ih weephaak tiit ah mina suh baat thuksuh, mih wasiit Joon ngeh ih kongphaak kotte kaat thukta, <verse number="7" style="v"/>tiimnge liidi, heh tiitkhaap ah loongtang ih chaat rum ano hanpi toom ih rum ah. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Heh teewah bah amiisak di weephaak tah angta; weephaak tiit ah ba baatkaat taha. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Erah baatta langla amiisak weephaak ah angta, erah weephaak ah arah mongrep adi ra haano mina loongtang suh kaangtook koha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Jengkhaap ah langla arah mongrep adi angta, arah mongrep ah Rangte ih heh mendi hoonta bah uh, arah mongrep dowa mina ih tasamjat rumta. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Heh teewah deek akaan ni ra taha, erabah uh heh miloong ah ih heh jeng ah takap rumta. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Enoothong, o mina ih heh jeng ah kap ih rum ano hanpi rumta, erah miloong ah Rangte suh asah eh hoon suh epun e ah. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Neng loong ah Rangte sah ih hoonta, mina hansi nuh awah nawa tup arah tah angta; Rangte ah neng loong raangtaan ih neng Wah eh hoonta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Jengkhaap ah mina eh donghoonta eno minchan nyia amiisak pan angta, seng loong damdi roong songtong taha. Heh rangka ah seng ih tup eti, erah rangka ah Hewah jiin nawa Hesah heh luulu ang thoidi choha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Joon ih heh tiit baatta adoh erongrongwah ih riibaatta, “Arah tiit ah ngah ih amah kabaat rum taha, ‘Heh nga lidoh raaha, enoothong nga nang ih heh elong ang ah, tiimnge liidi ngah maang tup diidook heh eje angta.’”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Heh jiinni minchan ehan je thoidi loongtang suh romseetam koh hali, seng loong asuh esiit esiit suh romseetam koh hali. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Rangte ih Moses jun ih Hootthe kota, enoothong minchan nyia amiisak tiit ah Jisu Kristo jun ih koh hali. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Rangte ah oh ih uh tathaak tupka. Rangte reeni Hewah tooto ih tongla, Hesah asuh luulu ba jatthuk ha.</para>
  <para style="s">Juutemte Joon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Jerusalem dowa Jehudi ngoong awang loong ah ih romwah nyia Lewi nok hah marah marah loong ah Joon reeni kaat thuk rum ano, chengkaat thuk rumta, “An o anglu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Joon ih neng suh ngaakbaat ah tah daanta, enoothong neng suh saasa ih dokbaat rumta, Heh ih baat rumta: &lt;&lt;Ngah Kristo tah angkang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 18:15">Hodb 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref> </char>
    </note> &lt;&lt;Eno bah, an ah o anglu?&gt;&gt; Neng ih ngaak chengta. &lt;&lt;An Elija tam ah?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">“Tah angkang,” Joon ih ngaakbaat rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">“An Khowah tam anglu?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Khowah: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">O mina ih Kristo kaat tiit baanbaat kaatte warah</char></note> Neng loong ah ih ngaakcheng rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">“Tah angkang,” Joon ih ngaakbaat rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Eno bah an ah o anglu baat he,” neng loong ah ih cheng rumta. “Seng daap kaatte loong asuh an o anglu erah tiit ah ngaakbaat wantheng. An teewah suh an ih tiimjih li hu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa 40:3</ref> </char>
    </note>Khowah Isaia Jengkhaap ah baat ano ngaak jengta;</para>
  <para style="p">&lt;&lt;Phisang hah mong ni riila root ah langla ngah;</para>
  <para style="p">Teesu lengkhoom suh lamjun in ban tan an!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pharisi nok hah, ih kaat thukta kongphaak kotte, loong ah ih <verse number="25" style="v"/>Joon suh cheng rumta,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kongphaak kotte marah Pharisi loong ih kaat thukta, erah langla; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Neng loong ah maradi Pharisi loong angta erah di kaat thuk rumta; neng.</char></note> &lt;&lt;An Kristo uh tah angko, Elija uh tah angko adoleh Khowah uh tah angko, eno bah juutem ah mamah ih temhu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Joon ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih ju nawa ih juutem rumhala, enoothong sengdung ni wasiit chapla ah sen ih tajatkan. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Erah mih ah nga lih ni ra hala, enoothong ngah bah heh lakhoop adoleh heh lasong khook haattha uh taluikang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Arah tiit ah Bethani ni Joon ih Jordan ju saadongko ni juutemta erah di roongwaan rumta.</para>
  <para style="s">Rangte Saapsah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Erah saalih adi Jisu heh taang ni wangha rah Joon ih japtup ano, liita, &lt;&lt;Rangte Saapsah ah arah, arah mongrep dowa rangdah saasiitte ah erah wang hala! <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ngah roongwaan tahang adi arah warah tiit laangbo baat rum taha, ngah ih amah baat rum taha, ‘Nga lidoh mih wasiit raaha, enoothong heh ngah nang ih elong, tiimnge liidi heh ngah maang tupdoh heh eje angta.’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ngah ih heh o ang ah ngeh ih tah jattang, enoothong, heh ah Ijirel noksong ih toomjat rum ah ngeh ih juutem ra tahang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Eno Joon ih heteewah tiitkhaap tiit baat rumta: &lt;&lt;Ngah ih Chiiala ah wotuupi likhiik rang nawa ra haano heh sakkhoh ni dangra ha rah tuptang. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Erabah uh ngah ih tajattang heh o angla. Enoothong juutem kaat thuk tahang Rangte ah ih baat tahang, ‘An ih Chiiala ra haano mih wasiit sak nah tong raaha rah japtup uh; Esa Chiiala nawa ih juutemte warah heh ang ah.’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ngah ih tup ehang,” Joon ih liita, &lt;&lt;eno ngah ih baat rumhala Rangte Sah ah bah heh ju.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu liphante loong phangdongta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Erah saalih adi heliphante wanyi damdi Joon we toonchap adi, <verse number="36" style="v"/>Jisu lengkhoom ah japtup ano liita. &lt;&lt;Rangte Saapsah ah the warah aleh!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Heliphante wanyi ah ih Joon jeng ah japchaat nyu ano Jisu damdi roong kanyuuta. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Jisu lekchap ih adi, nengnyi helilih ih kah arah japtup nyu ano cheng nyuuta, &lt;&lt;Set ih tiimjih jamsok hansih?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Nengnyi ih ngaakbaat nyuuta, &lt;&lt;An mani tonglu Rabbi?&gt;&gt; (Rabbi ah Hebrew lam ih &lt;&lt;Nyootte&lt;&lt; suh liiha)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Sok raathaak hansih ba,” heh ih ngaakbaat nyuuta. (Erah tokdi rangsa lup nanah angta.) Erah thoidi heh damdi roong kah nyu ano heh mani songtongta rah japtup kanyuuta eno erah sa adi heh damdi naangjam nyuuta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Erah nyi dowa wasiit ah Simon Pitar no Andriu angta. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Erah damdam heh phoh Simon ah japtup ano baatta, &lt;&lt;Seknyi Misia chomui li tih.&gt;&gt; (Misia ah &lt;&lt;Kristo&lt;&lt; suh liiha) <verse number="42" style="v"/>Eno heh ih Simon ah Jisu taang ni siitwanta.</para>
  <para style="p">Jisu heh taangko sok ano liita, &lt;&lt;An Joon sah Simon, enoothong an ah Sephas ngeh ih poonho.&gt;&gt; (Erah langla Pitar suh &lt;&lt;jong&lt;&lt; ngeh ih liita likhiik)</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ih Philip nyia Nathanel poonta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Erah saalih adi Jisu Galili ni kaat chungta. Heh ih Philip ah japtup ano baatta, &lt;&lt;Nga damdoh roongra ho!&gt;&gt; (<verse number="44" style="v"/>Philip ah Pitar nyia Andriu tongla hah, Betsaida nawa angta.) <verse number="45" style="v"/>Philip ih Nathanel ah japtup ano heh suh baatta, &lt;&lt;Hootthe leedap ni Moses nyia khowah loong ih nep raangta ah seng ih japtup ehi. Heh langla Jisu, Najaret hadaang dowa Josep sah ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Najaret nawa tiim bah uh ese thok nih eha?&gt;&gt; Nathanel ih chengta.</para>
  <para style="p">&lt;&lt;Raaho no sok uh,” Philip ih ngaak baatta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Jisu ih Nathanel ah heh reeni kaat ah tup ano liita, &lt;&lt;Ijirel mina mi abah arah; heh tiim ni uh tathika!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nathanel ih heh suh chengta, An ih ngah mamah ih jat halang?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Jisu ih ngaak baatta, &lt;&lt;Philip ih maang poon ruudi phuksak bang lathong ni ang uh rah jap tup taha.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Nyootte&lt;&lt; Nathanel ih ngaak baatta, &lt;&lt;an juuba Rangte Sah! An Ijirel Luuwang!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Jisu ih chengta, &lt;&lt;Phuksak bang lathong ni angtu adi japtup taha ngeh ih li kohaano tam hanpi halang? An ih erah tokkhodoh elong japtup uh!&gt;&gt; <verse number="51" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Rangph 28:12</ref></char></note>Eno neng suh li rumta, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih amiisak tiit ah baat rumhala: Rangmong ah laangdaap adoh Rangsah loong ah Mina Sah reenah chookwang datkah ih lengkhoom arah japtup an.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kana ni kuhoonta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Saanyi lidi Kana samnuthung ko Galili hah ni kuhoonta. Jisu nuh uh erah ni angta, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Jisu nyia heliphante loong ah nep kuhoon thengni poon rumta. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kham ah thoonphe korum ano, heh nuh ih Jisu suh baatta, &lt;&lt;Neng jiinni kham ah takah jeeka.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Jisu ih liita, &lt;&lt;tiimjih etheng ah ngasuh nakbaat hang.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Nga saapoot maang thokra.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Eno Jisu nuh ih neng laksuh loong asuh baatta, &lt;&lt;Heh ih tiim etheng baat han erah re anjoh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Jehudi loong juusaakaat ah neng banlam angta, erah raangtaan ih jong tekpoh arok ah banthiin roh ih rumta, tekpoh esiit ni ju ah rooknyi rookjom piipa taan thosak theng angta. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Jisu ih heh laksuh loong asuh baatta, &lt;&lt;Arah tekpoh loong adoh joong ah meeke an.&gt;&gt; Neng loong ah ih hesiitsiit ih meeke rum kano, <verse number="8" style="v"/>Jisu ih baat rumta. &lt;&lt;Bolam bah joong ah we ngaakke anno saroom phaksat sokboite warah asuh kokaat an.&gt;&gt; Heh laksuh loong ah ih ju ah phaksat sokboite warah asuh kokaat rumta, <verse number="9" style="v"/>eno erah kham eh hoonta, erah warah ih thaakjok ih adi kham sumsum eta. Heh ih kham ah manawa angta erah tajatta, (enoothong, joongkeete loong ah ih ba jat eta); erah thoidi jaalah kapte warah poon ano <verse number="10" style="v"/>heh suh liita. &lt;&lt;Mirep ih kham eseethoon ah jaakhoh phe koha, eno wenwah loong ih phootjok taano, thaangne kham ah pheekoh ah. Erabah uh amadi tuk ih kham eseethoon ah thokthiin hu!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Jisu ih paatjaajih ah Kana hadaang Galili ni phang mokata, erah di hechaan hephaan ah jatthuk rumta, eno heliphante loong ah ih hanpi ih rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:13">Mat 4:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Erah lih adi Jisu nyia heh nuh, hephoh heno, erah damdi heh laksuh loong ah Kaparnam ni wang rum ano saajombaji tongwang rumta.</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Rangteenook ni wangta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12">Mat 21:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mk 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45">Luk 19:45</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 19:46">46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Hpkt 12:1-27</ref> </char>
    </note>Khopi kuwaang lang nanah ang kano, Jisu Jerusalem ni kata. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Erah ni miwah loong ah Rangteenook ni luiamaan, saap, tokparu sangte nyia ngun lekte teebun ni thiin arah japtup kata. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Erah thoidi Jisu ih luiamaan nyia saap loong ah ruh nawa ih Rangteenok dowa phanbuta; ngun lekte teebun ah loonghaat ano jaan ngunsah loong ah wenhaat eta; <verse number="16" style="v"/>eno tokparu sangte loong asuh baatta, &lt;&lt;Adowa dokpi ih kaat an! Sengwah nok ah thaangsang theng nak hoon an!&gt;&gt; <verse number="17" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Rsb 69:9</ref> </char></note>Heliphante loong ah ih Rangteele ni emah ih raangha ah samthun rumta, &lt;&lt;O Rangte, an nok suh mongmah lang ah nga ten ni weelu ah likhiik luula.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Jehudi ngoong awang loong ah ih ngaakwang rum haano Jisu suh cheng rumta, &lt;&lt;An ih emah jen re ang ngeh ih noisok suh an ih seng suh paatjaajih tiimjih jen noisok he?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Arah Rangteenook ah thaak haat ih an, sa jom lidoh Ngah ih weengaak hoon ih ang.&gt;&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mat 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:40">27:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mk 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:29">15:29</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;An ih sa jom doh weengaak hoon ih uh nih?&gt;&gt; Neng ih cheng rumta. &lt;&lt;Arah Rangteenook ah tomhoon suh rookbaji paang arok laakiita!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Enoothong Jisu ih Rangteenook tiit baatta ah heh sakpuh tiit baatta. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih heh tek nawa ngaaksaat taadoh, erah jengta ah heliphante loong ih samthun ih rumta, eno neng ih Rangteele ni liiha ah nyia Jisu jengta rah hanpi ih rumta.</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ih mina banlam jat eta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Khopi Kuwaang haangdi Jisu Jerusalem ni angta doh, heh ih paatjaajih loong ah re kano mina hantek ih hanpi rumta. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Enoothong Jisu ih neng tenthun ah jat ano heteewah neng suh talaalom rumta. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mina loong tiit ah heh suh mih ih baattheng ju tah angta, tiimnge liidi neng tenthun ah heh teewah ih jat ih rumta.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu nyia Nikodimas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Jehudi noksong phansiitte Nikodimas ngeh ih Pharisi mih wasiit angta. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pheesiit Jisu reeni wang ano li wangta, &lt;&lt;Chuupha, seng ih jat ehi an Rangte ih kaat thuk ho rah nyootte warah ah. Rangte heh damdoh lah angka bah an reelu paatjaajih loong ah o uh tajen reeka. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaatta, “Ngah ih amiisak tiit ah baat hala; o uh weedop tup lah eka bah Rangte hasong ah mabah uh tachoh tupka ang ah.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">weedop tup; </char><char style="fq" closed="false">adoleh </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rangmong nawa ih</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Mihak ah mamah ma we ngaak dongtup ah?” Nikodimas ih chengta. “Amiimi dobah heh nuh mong nah tami ngaak nopka eno dopnyi tami doptup ka!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Ngah ih amiisak tiit ah baat hala,” Jisu ih ngaakbaatta, “Ju nyia Chiiala nah latupka bah Rangte Hasong nah o uh tajen nop wangka. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mina ah hansi ni henuh hewah ih dongtup ha; enoothong chiiala lam dobah Chiiala nawa ih tup ah. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Sen loong ah weedop tup jaatjaat etheng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">weedop tup; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">or </char><char style="fq" closed="false">rangmong nawa ih. </char></note> ngeh ih baatrum kohaano nak paatja an. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pong ah madi pongtheng ah erah di pongla; sen ih pong huuk ah ba chaat han, enoothong manawa pongwang hala nyia maako pong kala erah an ih tajatko. Erah raangtaan ih o mina Chiiala nawa ih tup ha mirep erah likhiik ang ah.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Emah mamah mi ang ah?” Nikodimas ih chengta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaatta. “Ijirel ni nyootte elong laangma ang uh, eno an ih erah tanih jatko? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ngah ih amiisak tiit ah baat hala: Seng ih marah jat hi erah jengli nyia marah tup hi erah ah baat hi, erabah uh sen loong ah ih o ih uh seng jengkhaap ah tathang kan. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Arah mongrep dowa jaatrep tiit baat rumhala ah sen ih tahanpi ri; eno, Rangmong hasong tiit baat rumhala tang ah, mamah ma ih hanpi an? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Eno rangmong ni wasiit taan uh maang thaak wangka, rangmong nawa ra taha Mina Sah ah luulu ba.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kook hoom eha hewet 21 dowa ih soktheng. </char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:9">Erok 21:9</ref> </char>
    </note> Phisaang hani Moses ih jaanmeen nawa hoon arah pu ah thong ni toonbotta, erah likhiik ih Mina Sah ah toonbot jaatjaat ih ah, <verse number="15" style="v"/>tiimnge liidi o mina ih heh hanpi ah erah mih rah ih lathoon roidong ah choh ah. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Rangte ih mongrep ah erah than ih minchanha Hesah wasiit luulu ah thoonkota, tiimnge liidi o mina ih heh hanpi ah erah tatiika erah nang ebah lathoon roidong ah ba choh ah. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Rangte ih Hesah ah arah mongrep dandeete tadaap jataha, erah nang ih khopui pang suh daapkaat taha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>O mina ih Hesah ah hanpiiha erah tadande ka ang ah; enoothong o mina ih lahanpiika erabah jen dande eta, tiimnge liidi heh ih Rangte Sah heh luulu ah tahanpiika. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Dande ah emamah ih dande kaat ah; weephaak ah mongrep ni phaak e ra hala, enoothong mina loong ah ih weephaak nang ih laamang asuh ese choha, tiimnge liidi neng reeraang ah ethih. <verse number="20" style="v"/>O mina ethih mokala erah mih ah ih weephaak ah echiik eha eno weephaak ni tawangra, tiimnge liidi neng ethih reeraang loong ah noisok suh tanook rumka. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Enoothong o mina ih amiisak moot ah mokala erah loong ah ba weephaak adoh thok haano heh reeraangta ah Rangte jeng chaatchaat ih reeta ngeh ih weephaak ah ih noisok rum ah.</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu nyia Joon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Erah lilih, Jisu nyia heliphante loong ah Judia hadaang ko ih karumta, erah ni Jisu neng damdi chomroe saapoot roongtong ano juutem thuk rumta. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Aenon ni ju ah hantek ang kano, Joon ih uh erah hah ni juutem rumta, erah hah ah Salim dowa ih haloh tah angta. Miloong ah heh reeni karumta, eno Joon ih ju ah tem ih rumta. (<verse number="24" style="v"/>Erah langla Joon phaatak ni maangsak kaadi.)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mk 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luk 3:19-20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Joon liphante loong dowa mararah ah Jehudi damdi neng banlam juusaakaat thoidi daanmui<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jehudi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mararah le ni </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mararah Jehudi </char></note> rumta. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Erah thoidi Joon reeni wangrum ano liiwang rumta, &lt;&lt;Nyootte, Jordan ju saadongko adi an damdi angta wah ah dokthun thaak uh, an ih kabaattu warah ah? Heh ih amadi juutem rumha, eno loongtang heh reeni karumla!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Joon ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;O suh uh Rangte ih lakoka bah tiim uh tachoka. <verse number="28" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Jn 1:20</ref> </char></note>Ngah ih baatrum taha nga haaki ah sen loong ah, ‘Ngah Kristo tah angkang, enoothong heh ngah ni ngah ban kaat thuk halang.’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Jaaro suh nookte jaalah ah heteenuh kapte jaaro ah raangtaan ih; eno jaalah kapte warah reeni chapla joonte loong ah heh root ah japchaat rum ano eroon ela. Nga tenroon ah emamah ih ang ah. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Jisu ah nga nang ih elong jaatjaat ang ah ngah ehin.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Rang nawa heh ra taha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>O khothung nawa ra hala ah loongtang nang ih elongthoon. O arah hah nawa dongla erabah arah hah raangtaan eno heh ih bah arah hatoh hadaang tiit baat ah, enoothong o rangmong nawa ra hala erabah loongtang nang ih echoong ni. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Heh ih tiimjaat tupta nyia chaatta ah baat ha, erabah uh heh tiitkhaap ah o ih uh takapka. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Enoothong o ih heh tiitkhaap ah kap eha erah dowa ih jattheng Rangte ah amiisak ju. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Rangte ih marah wasiit daapjah hala heh Rangte jeng jengla, tiimnge liidi heh suh Rangte ih Chiiala thoontang koha. <verse number="35" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mat 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luk 10:22</ref> </char></note>Hewah ih Hesah ah rapne ih minchan thoidi jirep ah heh chaan hephaan khui ni thiinkoha. <verse number="36" style="v"/>O ih Hesah ah hanpi eha erah taang ni lathoon roidong ah jeela; Hesah jeng laboichaatte loong asuh bah roidong tajeeka, erah nang ebah Rangte tenkhat khui nah cham ah.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu nyia Samariate minuh nusiit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Joon liphante loong nang ih Jisu ih juutem ehan japtem rum arah Pharisi loong ih japchaat rumta. (<verse number="2" style="v"/>Amimiidi bah, Jisu heteewah ih wasiit taan uh tatem rumta; heliphante loong ih luulu juutem rumta.) <verse number="3" style="v"/>Eno Jisu ih erah baatmui rumta ah japchaat ano Judia nawa doksoon ano Galili ni ngaak wangta; <verse number="4" style="v"/>heh wang ih adoh Samaria lam ih wangte jaatjaat angta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Heh Samaria ni Sikar samnuh adi wang taha, erah hah ah Jaakob ih heh sah Josep suh kota phek dowa ih haloh tah angta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:19">Rangph 33:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Jos 24:32</ref> </char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Jaakob naatbeng ah erah di angta, eno enaang ih ano Jisu lam ni erah re adi naangtongta. Erah tokdi rangnithung angta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Samariate minuh nusiit ju khoot wang kohaano, Jisu ih baatta, &lt;&lt;Ngah suh ju ah jok thuk weehang.&gt;&gt; (<verse number="8" style="v"/>Heliphante loong ah erah pootdi samnuh ni phaksat jamriik karumta.)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 4:1-5">Ijr 4:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 4:1">Neh 4:1</ref>,<ref loc="NEH 4:2">2</ref> </char>
    </note> Minuh rah ih ngaak liita, &lt;&lt;An Jehudi nok hah, ngah ah Samaria nok hah —eno an ih nga jiin nawa joong mamah mi sujok hang?&gt;&gt; (Jehudi loong ah ih Samariate ih maak ha huuikhaak ah tami room maakka)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Samaria nok hah ih maak ha lookkep ah Jehudi nok hah ih tah room maakka; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jehudi nok hah loong ah Samaria nok hah damdi waan bot tah pa waanka </char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Jisu ih liita, “Rangte ih tiimjaat koha erah ah jat ubah nyia an jiin nawa joong sukjokte warah jattu bah, an ih suk ih thengtu, eno heh ih an suh roidong ju ah kottheng taho.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Minuh ah ih liita, &lt;&lt;Chuupha,” &lt;&lt;an jiinni joongpi theng uh amuh, eno naatbeng ah uh echoong dook. An ih erah roidong ju ah manawa ma choh uh? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Arah naatbeng ah sengte sengwah Jaakob ih kohe rah; helui hemaan, heh sah loong nyia heteewah ih arah jok dowa. Jaakob nang ih elong ngeh nakmok thun uh, emah nih mokthun hu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Jisu ih erah nuh asuh liita, &lt;&lt;O ih arah ju ah jok ah heh joongle ih we le e ah, <verse number="14" style="v"/>enoothong ngah ih koh angrah ju ah jok abah mabah uh joongle ih takah we leeka . Ngah ih koh angrah ju abah heh roidong juumik eh hoon ah eno erah juumik rah ih roidong ju ah koh ano lathoon roidong ah koh ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Chuupha&lt;&lt; minuh rah ih liita, &lt;&lt;erah joong ah ngasuh kohang! Enooba ngah joongle ih mabah uh takah leekang, arah doh joong khoot uh takah raarang ang ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Jisu ih baatta, &lt;&lt;An miwah poonkah uh,” eno &lt;&lt;ngaakwang ho.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Nga miwah tajeeka,” erah nuh rah ih ngaak baatta.</para>
  <para style="p">Jisu ih ngaak liita, &lt;&lt;An miwah amuh liihu ah an punjeng elu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Amadi tuk ih wabangnga suh nooklu, eno amadi o damdi tonglu erah uh amiisak di an miwah tah angka. An ih amiitiit ah ju baat halang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Chuupha ngah ih jat ih hala, an khowah,” minuh ah ih ngaak liita. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Sengwih sengte Samaria nok hah loong ah ih arah kong adi Rangte kah soomtu rumta, enoothong Jehudi sen loong ah ih seng subah Jerusalem hah nah soomtu theng ngeh liihan.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Jisu ih erah nuh asuh baatta, &lt;&lt;An ih nga jeng ah hanpi hang, saapoot jaasiit thok eha mina loong ah ih Jerusalem nah adoleh arah kong adoh Hewah rang lasoom thang ih tong rum arah ah. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Samriate sen loong ah ih o rangsoom han amiimi tajatkan; enoothong seng Jehudi nok hah ih bah jat ehi o rangsoom hi erah ah, tiimnge liidi khopiiroidong ah Jehudi nawa ra hala. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Enoothong saapoot thok eha amadi jen thok e hala, tiimtok doh mina loong ah ih Rangte Chiiala chaan nawa ih Hewah ah amiisak di mamah ah erah likhiik ih phoongpha adoh, heh ih mamah ih thunha erah tenthun jun ih phoongpha ah. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Rangte ah Chiiala, eno mina loong ah ih Chiiala jun ebah heh mamah ah erah likhiik ih somtu rum ah.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Minuh ah ih Jisu suh baatta, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih jat ehang Kristo ah erak eha, eno Heh raaha doh, jirep ah baat ehe.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaak baatta, &lt;&lt;Erah liihu ah ngah hanih, amadi an damdi o waan hala warah ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Erah pootdi Jisu liphante loong ah ngaakwang e rum taha, eno minuh damdi roongwaan ah japtup rum ano rapne ih paatja rumta. Enoothong neng loong dowa o ih uh minuh asuh tali rumta, &lt;&lt;an ih tiimjih jamhu ngeh ih uh tali rumta?&gt;&gt; Adoleh Jisu suh uh tacheng rumta, &lt;&lt;an arah nuh ah damdi tiimnge roongwaan lu ngeh ah?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Eno minuh rah ih heh joong khoot tek ah thinhaat ano samnuh ni ngaak wangta, eno erah dowa miloong asuh baatwan rumta, <verse number="29" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Nga roidong di jirep reeraang tang erah dok baat halang mih ah sok ra thaak han. Heh Kristo ah ma angja oh?&gt;&gt; <verse number="30" style="v"/>Erah thoidi erah samnuh dowa dokkhoom rum ano Jisu jiinni karumta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Erah saapoot adi hehliphante loong ah ih Jisu lasih joh rumta, &lt;&lt;Nyootte, tiim ah tiim phaksah uh!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Enoothong Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Nga jiinni phaksat theng eje eno sen ih erah tiit ah tajatkan.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Erah thoidi heliphante loong ah neng jaachi ni phang chengmui rumta, &lt;&lt;Heh suh o ih bah uh phaksat pi tam ih kaat rum taha?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Jisu ih li rumta, &lt;&lt;nga phaksat ah langla nga daapkaatte warah ih mootkaat baat halang ah thoon pakna reeraang theng nyia boichaat theng.&gt;&gt; <verse number="35" style="v"/>Sen tiitthaak ni eje, ‘Chamkhan suh la baji tongla.’ Enoothong ngah ih baat rumhala, phek ah rapniine ih sok an; chamloong ah amadi khan esuh jen men ela! <verse number="36" style="v"/>O mina ih chamkhanha erah suh kot eha nyia lathoonka roidong cham ah lomkhan thuk ha; erah thoidoh o ih wenha nyia o ih khanha nengnyi eroom ih tenroon ang ah. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Tiitthaak ah amiisak, ‘Wasiit ih wen eha, wasiit ah ih khan eha.’ <verse number="38" style="v"/>Sen loong marah phek adi tamoh katan erah dowa khan kaat thuk rumhala; erah di wahoh mokata, eno neng mokata dowa sen ih dakchoh an.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Erah samthung adi songtongte Samariate hantek ih minuh ah ih baatrum kano Jisu ah hanpi ih rumta, &lt;&lt;Ngah reeraang tang jirep ah dokbaat tahang.&gt;&gt; <verse number="40" style="v"/>Eno Samariate loong ah Jisu taang ni wangrum haano, neng damdoh roongtong suh heh lasih jorumta, eno erah ni Jisu ah saanyi tongthiinta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Heh tiitkhaap ah chaat rum ano hantek ih we boot hanpi rumta, <verse number="42" style="v"/>eno minuh asuh li rumta, &lt;&lt;Seng ih hanpi ehi, an jeng chaat raang ih tahanpiike, enoothong seng teeteewah ih heh jeng ah chaat enooba hanpi hi, seng ih jat ehi amiisak heh ah mongrep puipangte.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ih saahaap sah deesiitta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Erah ni saanyi tongthiin ano Jisu Galili ni dokkhoom wangta. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Jisu heh teeteewah ih baatta, &lt;&lt;Khowah loong ah nengdeek nengkaan ni tachoom joka.&gt;&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:57">Mat 13:57</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:4">Mk 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:24">Luk 4:24</ref></char></note> <verse number="45" style="v"/>Jisu Galili ni thok adi, erah dowa miloong ah ih jengse banra rumta, tiimnge liidi Khopi Kuwaang adi neng loong ah Jerusalem ni karumta adoh kuwaang adi jaatrep reeraangta loong ah neng ih japtup ih rumta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:23">Jn 2:23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:46 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 2:1-11">Jn 2:1-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Eno Jisu ah Galili hah Kaana samthung adi ngaakwangta, maradi heh ih joong ah kham eh lek hoonthukta hah adi ah. Erah ni apit ni mootte saahaap wasiit angta eno heh sah ah langkoleh Keparnam ni khoisat angta. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Judia nawa Galili ni Jisu kaat ah japchaat ano erah warah Jisu jiinni wangta, eno heh sah khoisat deesiit Keparnam nah kaat weetheng ngeh ih baat wanta, erah sah ah tek nanah ih satta. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Jisu ih heh suh baatta, “Sen ih paatjaajih latup kanbah o ih uh tahanpi kan”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>“Chuupha,” saahaap ih ngaak baatta, “Nga sah maangti kaadoh wakra weeho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Jisu ih heh suh baatta, &lt;&lt;Kah uh, an sah ething ang ah!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Erah warah ih Jisu jengkhaap ah hanpi ano kata. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Heh nok ni ngaak kah adi heh laksuh loong ah lamni chomui rum ano baat rumta, &lt;&lt;An sah bah ese joh, thingtong e ah!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Heh ih cheng rumta tiim saapoot di heh sah ah deeta, eno ngaakbaat rumta. &lt;&lt;Miinnyah rangnithung lidi saapak esiit di heh khoisat ah deeta.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Eno hewah ah ih erah saapoot adi Jesu ih &lt;&lt;An sah ah ething&lt;&lt; ngeh ih baatta rah dokthunta. Erah thoidi neng jaatang changtom ih hanpi rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Judia nawa Galili ni kaat lidi Jisu ih epaatjaajih reeraang ah taknyi noisokta.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Juutum ni khoisat deeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Erah lih adi, Jisu Jerusalem ni kuwaang raangtaan ih wangta. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Jerusalem ni Saap Paakaawan reeni juutum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Saap Pakaawan reeni juutum</char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Saap Juutum reeni </char></note> esiit je ah erah di taapbulaang bangnga angta; Hebrew jengdi erah suh Bethjatha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mararah le ni Bethesda liiha</char></note> liiha. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Erah taapbulaang khui adi khoisatte hantek jupthiin rumta erah di edook, ekoong, nyia huuimu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mararah hewet ni 3-4 ah wakraang ha: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Neng loong ah ih juutum lengphui ah kabansok rumta, </char><char style="fv">4</char> tiimnge liidi Teesu rangsah ah kah ano ju ah kalengphui thukta. Ju ah lengphui kano khoisatte o jakhoh juutum adi temkata, tiim khoisat ang ah bah uh erah minah ah kadeeta. </note> nang angta. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Neng loong ah juutum lengphui ah bansok rumta, erah juutum ah Teesu rangsah ah kah ano ju ah kalengphui thukta, o mina tiimjaat khoisat ang abah uh erah juutum lengphui adi o jaakhoh temkata erah kadeeta. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Erah di mih wasiit rookjom pang asat sat arah angta. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Jisu ih erah di loongjupta mih ah japtup ano, sa hantek satla ngeh ih jat eta; erah thoidi chengta, &lt;&lt;An de esuh enook nih ih lu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Khoisatte ah ih ngaakbaatta, &lt;&lt;Chuupha, juutum ah lengphui adi nga datthiin kaatte o uh takajeeka; erah tokdi nopwang taatchung leh, jaakhoh wahoh kanop wang ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Jisu ih heh suh liita, &lt;&lt;toonchap uh, an dam ah toonpi uno, khoom uh.&gt;&gt; <verse number="9" style="v"/>Erah baat kano erah mih ah lakdamdam ih deeta; heh dam ah toonpi ano phang toonkhoomta.</para>
  <para style="p">Erah sa ah Jehudi naangtongsa ja angta, <verse number="10" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:19">Neh 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21">Jer 17:21</ref></char></note>erah thoidi Jehudi ngoong awang loong ih khoisat deeta warah suh li rumta, &lt;&lt;Chiinnyah Jehudi naangtongsa, erah raangtaan ih an dam toonpi ah seng hootthe jun ih tapunka.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Heh ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Nga khoisat deesiitte warah ih dam ah toonpi thuk hangno khoom thuk tahang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Neng ih chengta, &lt;&lt;An suh emah re thukte ah o ah?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Enoothong khoisat deeta warah ih Jisu ah o angta ah tajatta, erah di mih hantek angkano, Jisu ah erah dowa doksoon ih kata.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lini, Jisu ih erah mih ah Rangteenook ni japtup ano baatta, &lt;&lt;Boichaat uh, amadi an khoisat ah de etu; erah raangtaan ih rangdajih lakah reetheng erah khodoh ethih phomok cham uh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Eno erah mih ah doksoon kah ano Jehudi ngoong awang loong asuh baatkaat rumta heh khoisat deesiitte ah Jisu angta ngeh ah. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Erah thoidi Jehudi naangtongsa di deesiit kano, Jehudi loong ah ih Jisu ah phang siikhaam rumta. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Seng Wah ah saarookwet ih mokala, eno Ngah uh emamah ih mokah ang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Heh jengkhaap ah ih Jehudi ngoong awang loong ah heh tek haat suh ehanhan ih samthun thuk rumta; naangtongsa hootthe luulu lathet hoom, Rangte asuh seng Wah ngeh ih li ano Rangte ah heteewah thanthan ih samthunha.</para>
  <para style="s">Hesah chaanphaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Erah thoidi Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih amiisak baat rumhala; Hesah ah heh thungthung ih tiim uh tami reeka; Hewah tiim mokala erah sok ano reela. Hewah tiim reela, Hesah uh erah re ah. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Tiimnge liidi Hewah ih Hesah ah rapne ih minchanha eno heh tiimjih mokala erah ah noisok ha. Arah nang ih elong mootkaatjih uh noisok ih ah, eno sen loong erah suh paatja e an. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hewah ih tek nawa ngaaksaat thuk ano roidong koha, erah likhiik ih Hesah ih uh o suh kotthung ah erah suh roidong koh ah. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Adoleh Hewah ih wasiit taan uh tadande ka. Hesah suh jen dande ih thuk ha, <verse number="23" style="v"/>tiimnge liidi Hesah ah Hewah likhiik ih toom choomjoh rum ah ngeh ah. O ih Hesah lasoomtu ka heh daapkaatte Hewah rah uh tasoomtu ka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Ngah ih amiisak baat rumhala; o mina ih nga jeng boichaat ano nga daapkaatte ah hanpi ha erah mina taang ni lathoonka roidong ah je ah. Heh abah tadande ka ang ah, heh tek lam dowa roidong ko jen nopwang eta. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ngah ih amiisak baat rumhala; saapoot ah thok e hala—jenthok ih taha—tekte loong ah ih Rangte Sah root japchaat adoh, boichaatte loong ah ih roidong choh ah. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hewah heteteewah ah, roidong lampo angla likhiik, Hesah rah uh erah likhiikkhiik roidong lampo. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Eno Hesah asuh mi dande esuh chaan aphaan ah koha, tiimnge liidi heh ah Mina Sah. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Arah suh nak paatja an; tekte loong ah ih heh root boichaat saapoot ah ethok ehala <verse number="29" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12:2</ref> </char></note> eno neng loong ah mangbeng nawa dokkhoom eha; oh jaase ih mokata erah loong ah ngaaksaat ano ething tong ah, eno o ethih mokata erabah ngaaksaat ih adoh dut haat ih ah.</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu haaki loong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Nga chaan nawa ih ngah ih tiim uh tajen reekang; Rangte ih baat halang jun ih ba dande hang, erah raangtaan ih ngah ih dande hang ah epun ang ah, tiimnge liidi nga tenthun nawa ih tareekang, enoothong nga daapkaatte warah ih tiim thun ha erah mootkaatte .</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Mih suh nga teewah tiit ah mokbaat angbah, ngah ih marah baat hang erah elang ekah ngeh ih mih ih takapka ang ah. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Enoothong nga tiit baatte wahoh eje, eno ngah ih jat ehang nga tiit marah heh ih baat ha erah amiisak tiit ah baat ha. <verse number="33" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-27">Jn 1:19-27</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:27-30">3:27-30</ref> </char></note> Sen ih Joon reeni heh jeng boichaat suh mih daap wantan, eno Joon ih ami tiit ah baatta. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ngah mina dowa haaki eje jaatjaat angtheng ngeh ih taliikang; arah jenglang abah sen khoh toompui an ngeh ih jenglang. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Joon ah weetook phaakjaaja ih lu arah likhiik, eno sen loong ah heh weephaak asuh pootsiit eroon etan. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Enoothong Joon ih haaki kotahan nang ih nga teeteewah ih haaki korumhala ah elong; ngah ih tiimjih mokalang, erah seng Wah ih mootkaat thuk halang, erah mokalang loong ah jun ih nga ah seng Wah ih kaatthuk halang ngeh ih jatthuk rumhala. <verse number="37" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3:22</ref> </char></note> Eno nga daapkaatte, seng Wah ih uh, nga teewah tiit ah ju jatthuk halan. Sen ih heh root uh maang taat chaatkan nyia hethe hekhoh uh maang thaak tupkan, <verse number="38" style="v"/>eno heh tiitkhaap uh sen ten ni tathiin kan, tiimnge liidi heh daapkaatte warah ah tahanpi kan. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Sen ih Rangteele ah wet ehan, sen ih mokthun han erah doh lathoonka roidong ah choh e ih ngeh ah. Eno Rangteele adi nga tiit baat ha! <verse number="40" style="v"/>Rah bah uh lathoonka roidong chosuh nga reeni wangsuh o uh tanook kan.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Ngah ih mina ih phoongpha tajamkang. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Enoothong sen tiimjaat mina ah ngah ih jat ih rumhala, eno ngah ih jat ih rumhala sen ten ni Rangte minchan ah taje kan. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Seng Wah chaan ah kap angno ra halang, enoothong sen ih nga jeng ah tathang kan; erah thaknang eh, marah marah heh chaan nawa ih ra hala, erah jeng ah ba thang han. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Sen ih sen jaachi ni phoongpha mui ah jamhan, enoothong Rangte taangnawa ra hala esiit luulu ah ih toom gu hang ngeh ih tasamthun kan; erah raangtaan ih sen ih mamah ma ih hanpi he?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nakmok thun an, seng Wah suh ngah ih sen tiit thetbaatte ngeh ah. Sen thetbaatte abah, sen ih tuumaang han, Moses ah ba ang ah. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Sen ih Moses ah amiisak ih hanpi tanbah, sen ih ngah uh hanpi etheng ang tahe, tiimnge liidi Moses ih nga tiit ah raangta. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Enoothong heh ih tiim raangta erah lahanpi phiino, Ngah ih liihang ah batang ah mamah ma ih hanpi an?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu ih haajaat bangnga suh phaksat thukta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Arah lidi, Jisu Galili Juusitum ah daansoon kata (erah suh, Taiberia Juusitum ngeh uh men eha). <verse number="2" style="v"/>Khoisatte loong ah epaatja etheng ih deesiitta ah tuprum ano miloong ah helilih ih phankhoom rumta. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Jisu kong adi duuwaang ano heliphante loong ah damdi roongtong wangta. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Khopi Kuwaang saapoot ah thok ih taha. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Jisu ih miloong ah jamsok adi hantek heh reeni wang arah japtupta, erah thoidi Philip suh chengta, &lt;&lt;Aathan mina suh kotsuh manawa phaksat choh reh ih?&gt;&gt; (<verse number="6" style="v"/>Heh ih Philip suh thamtham ih thaak chengta; amiidi baleh heh ih tiim etheng erah jat eta.)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Philip ih ngaakbaatta, “Baanlo ah loongtang ih cheeru phak raangtaan ih botseh, chaanyi nang ih ehan ngunkholok<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ngunkholok</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ngunkholok ah langla mina loong ah ih saasiit lakbi thaang kaniik rumta (Mat 20:2 doh sok an)</char></note> ih ba lui reh ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Heliphante changdowa wahoh, Andriu, ngeh ih Simon Pitar no angta ah ih liita, <verse number="9" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Adi miwasah wasiit je ah, heh taang ni wong nawa hoon arah baanlo bangnga je ah erah damdi nyasi enyi. Enoothong erah than mina suh tabaam luika.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Miloong ah tongthuk an,” Jisu ih baat rumta. (Erah di naam nang angta.) Erah thoidi miloong ah tong rumta; erah di miwah rooproop ih haajaat bangnga ang rumta. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Jisu ih baanlo ah toonpi ano, Rangte suh lakookmi liita, eno erah di tongte loong asuh pheekokaat thuk rumta. Nyasi ah uh emamah ih pheekoh rumta, eno neng ih mathan ih phaksah ah erah than ih korumta. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Neng wok ah phoot phaksah rum ano, heliphante loong asuh baatta, &lt;&lt;baanlo chep dakla loong ah khoontoon ih an; amasah uh lathaaja theng.&gt;&gt; <verse number="13" style="v"/>Baanlo bangnga dowa miloong ah ih dakphakta ah asih hongnyi ni lomtoon rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Jisu ih epaatjaajih reeta ah tuprum ano, miloong ah ih liita, “Mongrep ni kaatte Khowah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Khowah: 1:21 adoh sok an</char></note> abah amiisak di heh ju!&gt;&gt; <verse number="15" style="v"/>Jisu ih jat eta miloong ah wangrum haano neng Luuwang laat angthuk suh jowang rumha ngeh ah; erah raangtaan ih Jisu heluulu kong ko soonwangta.</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ju khoni khoomta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:2-33">Mat 14:2-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mk 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Rangja ang kano, Jisu liphante loong ah juusitum ko ih karumta, <verse number="17" style="v"/>eno khoonkhu adi duukah rum ano, juusitum lam ih Kaparnam ko ih daansoon wang rumta. Rang jennak ih adi uh, Jisu neng taang ni tangaak ra taha. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Neng taangko pong ah rapne ih pong ano ju ah rapne ih mootmotta. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Heliphante loong ah meejombaji taan daanjop rum adi, Jisu ju khoni khoom arah japtup rumta, heh khoonkhu ko ih ra taha eno neng loong ah echo ih rumta. <verse number="20" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Nakcho an,” Jisu ih baat rumta, &lt;&lt;Ngah hanih!&gt;&gt; <verse number="21" style="v"/>Erah lih adi khoonkhu ni toonhui rumta, eno neng kaat theng ko ih juukaang ni khoonkhu ah seek ih thoksoon kata.</para>
  <para style="s">Miloong ah ih Jisu matjam rumta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Erah saalih adi juusitum saangko dowa miloong ah ih dokthun rumta erah di khoonkhu ah esiit luulu ka ang ah ngeh ah. Neng ih jat eta Jisu heliphante loong ah damdi erah di takata, enoothong Jisu ah thiinhaat rum ano neng luulu karumta. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Taiberia dowa, khoonkhu ehoh loong ah, juukaang ni raarum taha maradi Teesu Jisu ih lakookmi li ano baanlo pheekoh rumta re adi ah. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Miloong ah ih, Jisu nyia helihphante loong ah, erah di lajaptup rum kaano Kaparnam ko wangte khoonkhu adi duuwang rum ano tumjam wang rumta.</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ah roidong baanlo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mina loong ah ih Jisu ah juusitum saangko japtup rum ano li rumta, &lt;&lt;Nyootte, an aradi mabah ra taho?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih sen loong asuh amiisak ih baat rumhala; ngah ih jat ehang sen loong ah ih baanlo ah sen wok laanphoot roh ih phak anno jam hali, paatjaajih reelang ah jat anno tah angka. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ethet ela phaksat raangtaan ih nak mokah an; erah nang ebah, lathoonka roidong phaksat raang ih mokah an, eno erah langla Mina Sah rah ih kohan, tiimnge liidi, Rangte Hewah ih heh mendi sin hoon thiinta.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Erah thoidi neng ih cheng rumta, &lt;&lt;Rangte ih seng suh reethuk suh liiha jun ih tiimjih jen re ih?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Rangte ih sen suh tiimre thukjih ah langla heh ih wasiit kaat thuk hala ah hanpi an.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Neng loong ah ih ngaakbaatta, &lt;&lt;Seng ih hanpi suh an ih paatjaajih tiimjih noisok he? An tiimjih re uh? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Phisaang hah ni sengte sengwah loong ih manna phakta, erah Rangteele ni liiha likhiik, ‘Neng loong asuh rangmong nawa Heh ih baanlo phakthuk rumta.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Hpkt 16:4</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 16:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Rsb 78:24</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Ngah ih amiisak baat rumhala,” Jisu ih baat rumta, &lt;&lt;Moses ih tiimjih koh tahan erah rangmong nawa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Moses ih tiimjih koh tahan erah rangmong nawa tah angta; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">erah kootte warah Moses tah angta.</char></note> baanlo tah angta; rangmong nawa amiisak baanlo kottte abah seng Wah. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Rangte ih koha baanlo ah langla o rangmong nawa ra hala erah, eno mongrep mina suh roidong koha.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Chuupha,” miloong ah ih surumta, “Arah baanlo ah saarookwet kohe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>“Roidong baanlo ah Ngah,” Jisu ih baat rumta. “O mina nga taang ni wang hala heh mabah uh ram ih tatiika; o mina ih ngah hanpi halang erah mih ah mabah uh joongle ih taleeka. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ngah ih, baat rumhala sen ih tup ih he bah uh tahanpi kan. <verse number="37" style="v"/>O mina seng Wah ih ngasuh kohalang ah nga taangnah wangha. Nga taang ni thokte ah o uh taphanhaat kang, <verse number="38" style="v"/>tiimnge liidi ngah rangmong nawa nga tenthun jun ih reesuh tara tahang enoothong ngah o ih daapkaat halang erah tenthun jun ih re suh ra tahang. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Eno nga daapkaatte tenthun ah langla ngasuh o koh halang erah loong ah ngah ih lamat haat theng, erah nang ebah rangthoon doh neng loong ah roidong raang ih ngaaksaat thuk ang. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Tiimnge liidi seng Wah ih jamha langla o ih Hesah ah japtup ano heh hanpi ha erah loong ah ih lathoonka roidong ah choh ah. Eno ngah ih neng loong ah rangthoon doh roidong chosuh ngaak saatsiit ang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Miloong ah Jisu thoidi phang jengmui rumta, tiimnge liidi Jisu ih liita, &lt;&lt;Rangmong nawa ra taha baanlo ah ngah.&gt;&gt; <verse number="42" style="v"/>Erah thoidi neng ih liita, &lt;&lt;Arah mih ah Joseph sah, Jisu tanih angka? Heh nuwah uh seng ih jat ehi. Eno, heh ih, rangmong nawa ra halang ngeh mamah ih miili ah?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Sen jaachi ni jengmui ah toihaat ih an. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nga daapkaatte seng Wah ih lathoksiit raabah o uh nga taangnah tami wangra; eno erah mih ah rangthoon doh roidong kot suh ngah ih ngaak saatsiit ih ang. <verse number="45" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Isa 54:13</ref></char></note> Khowah loong ih raangta, ‘Mina thoontang suh Rangte ih nyootsoot ah.’ O ang abah uh seng Wah jeng ah chaat ano kap ih abah erah mih ah nga taangnah wangha. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Seng Wah ah warep ih japtupchoi ngeh ih liijih tah angka; o heh jiin nawa ra hala erah ih luulu bah Hewah japtup ha. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Ngah ih amiisak baat rumhala; o mina ih hanpi ha erah mih ah ih ba lathoon roidong ah choh ah. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Roidong baanlo ah ngah. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Phisaang hah ni sente senwah loong ah ih manna phakta, erabah uh neng loong ah etek eta. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Enoothong rangmong nawa ra taha baanlo phakte ah tatiika. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Rangmong nawa ra taha ething baanlo ah ngah. Erah baanlo ah o ih phak ah, erah mih ah roitang tong ah. Heh suh baanlo kohang ah nga si, erah ngah ih mongrep nah thingtong suh kohang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Emah li kano Jehudi loong ah neng jaachi ni tenkhat lam ih phang daanmui rumta. &lt;&lt;Erah mih ah ih heh si mamah mi phakthuk he?&gt;&gt; Neng loong ah ih cheng rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih amiitiit ah baat rumhala; sen loong ah ih Mina Sah si ah laphak kanbah nyia heh sih ah lajok kanbah, sen jiinnah roidong tajeeka ang ah. <verse number="54" style="v"/>O ih nga si phak ah nyia nga sih jok ah heh suh ba lathoon roidong ah je ah, eno rangthoon doh ngah ih roidong raang ih heh ngaaksaat thuk ang. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Tiimnge liidi nga si ah amiimi phaksat theng; nga sih ah amiimi jokjih. <verse number="56" style="v"/>O mina ih nga si phak ah nyia nga sih jok ah erah nga damdi, eno ngah heh damdi tonglang. <verse number="57" style="v"/>Ething tongla Wah rah ih daapkaat halang, eno heh thoidi ba ngah uh thingtong elang. Erah likhiikhiik o ih nga si phak ha nga thoidoh heh uh ething tong ah. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Arah thoidi, rangmong nawa ra hala baanlo ah; sente senwah ih phakta baanlo ah likhiik tah angka, neng loong ah bah tek eta. O mina ih arah baanlo ah phak ah erabah roitang thingtong ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Kaparnam hani Jehudi rangsoomnok ni nyootsoot adi Jisu ih erah tiit ah baat rumta.</para>
  <para style="s">Lathoon roidong tiit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Helilih ih khoomte loong dowa hantek ih boichaat rum ano li rumta, &lt;&lt;Arah nyootsoot ha abah rapne ih echaan. O ih ma jen boichaat ah?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Labaat rumka bah uh, Jisu ih jat eta erah thoidi daanmui rumla ngeh ah, erah thoidi Jisu ih li rumta, &lt;&lt;Arah nyootsoot rumhala ah sen raang ih lanook chaat theng tam ah? <verse number="62" style="v"/>Jengthaak asuh, Mina Sah ah mani angta erah di ngaakwang ah tup anbah mamah ang ah? <verse number="63" style="v"/>Rangte Chiiala ih roidong koha; hansi chaan aphaan ebah tiim uh tajen eke. Sen damdi roongwaan halang tiitkhaap adi Rangte ih koh arah roidong Chiiala je ah. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Erabah sen loong dung dowa mararah ih tahanpi kan.&gt;&gt; (Jaakhoh dowa ih dook Jisu ih jat eta o mina ih tahanpi ka nyia o ih heh mokwaan ah.) <verse number="65" style="v"/>Eno Jisu ih we boot baatta, &lt;&lt;Erah thoidi ngah ih baatrum taha seng Wah ih lawang thukra bah nga taangnah o uh tajen wangra.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Erah thoidi, Jisu damdi roong khoomte loong ah hantek liko ngaak rum ano lidi takah roongkhoom rumta. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih heliphante asiwanyi asuh chengta, &lt;&lt;Sen loong ah nep—doksoon esuh enook nih lan?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>Simon Pitar ih liita, &lt;&lt;Teesu, seng loong ah o jinnah maakah kah ih? An jengkhaap ni ba lathoonka roidong tiit ah jeela.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:68 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:16">Mat 16:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:29">Mk 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:20">Luk 9:20</ref></char></note> <verse number="69" style="v"/>Eno amadi seng ih hanpi ehi nyia jat ehi an luulu juuba Rangte taangnawa raaho rah Esa warah ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaatbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih sen asiwanyi tanih danje rum taha? Erabah uh sendung dowa wasiit ah hakhoh luuwang!&gt;&gt; <verse number="71" style="v"/>Jisu ih Simon Iskariot sah, Judas tiit baatta. Tiimnge liidi Judas ah heliphante loongdung dowa heliphante taat ang abah uh, heh ih Jisu mokwaanta.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu nyia heh no loong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Erah lih adi, Jisu Galili ni tumkhoomta; Jehudi ngoong awang loong ah ih tek haat esuh jamrum kano, heh Judia ni tumkhoom suh tanookta. <verse number="2" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Lew 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13">Hodb 16:13</ref> </char></note>Jehudi Nyutaap hoon Kuwaang ah thok ih taha, <verse number="3" style="v"/>erah raangtaan ih heh no loong ah ih Jisu suh baat rumta, &lt;&lt;An reeraang ah an liphante loong ah ih toomjat asuh arah dowa Judia hah nah kah uh. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mih ih toom khomjat hang ngeh ih li abah o uh hotsu ih tareeka. An emah ih reelu bah, mongrep nah warep ih toom khomjat ho!&gt;&gt; (<verse number="5" style="v"/>Heh no loong ih taan uh tahanpi rumta.)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Jisu ih li rumta, &lt;&lt;Nga reeraang saapoot tok ah nga raang ih maang thokra. Sen suh ba tiim saapoot ang abah uh punroh ih ah. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mongrep dowa mina loong ah ih sen tamiksuk ran, tiimnge liidi neng reeraang pakna ethih tiit ah baatroh ih kangno, ngah ba miksuh rum halang. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Sen loong ah kuwaang adoh kaatba kah an, arah kuwaang adoh ngah tara rang,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngah tawang kang; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mararah le ni liiha </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Amadi tuk ih ngah maang wangkang.</char></note> tiimnge liidi nga saapoot ah maang thokra” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Emah ih baatrum ano, Jisu Galili ni tangtongta.</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu noknop kuwaang ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Heh no loong ah kuwaang ni kaat lidi, Jisu uh we kaat eta; enoothong, heh saasa lah angthang eh, hotsu ih kata. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Jehudi ngoong awang loong ah ih kuwaang adi bansokroh ih rumta. &lt;&lt;Heh mani ah?&gt;&gt; Ngoong awang loong ah ih cheng rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Miloong dung ni heh tiit ah rapne ih huwaan rumta. Mararah ih liita, “Heh wase,” rukho loong ah ih liita, “Tah angka,” mih thong moong mokwaan ha.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Enoothong ngoong awang loong raacho ih, wuusa ni o uh tajengta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Jisu ih Rangteenook ni phang nyootsoot wangta adoh kuwaang thako ah jenkuh ih rumta. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Jehudi ngoong awang loong ah rapne ih paatja rum ano jeng rumta, &lt;&lt;Arah mih ah iskun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iskun: Leenyoot nok </char></note> ni leewet mabah lataat kah kaarah erah than manawa ih jat ha?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih tiim nyootsoot hang erah nga thung ih tanyoot kang, erah langla nga daapkaatte, Rangte taangnawa ra hala. <verse number="17" style="v"/>O mina ih Rangte mongtham jun ih reesuh nookla erah mih ah ih ba jat ah ngah ih nyootsoot hang ah Rangte taangnawa tam nga thung ih nyootsoot hang. <verse number="18" style="v"/>O mina heh teewah chaan nawa jengla erah mih ah ih heh teeteewah rangka suh liiha. Enoothong o ih heh daapkaatte men ah rangka suh li abah erah mih ah ba toongtang, eno heh tamoongka ang ah. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Moses ih Hootthe tanih koh tahan? Enoothong sen loong ah ih wasiittaan ih uh takap kan. Nga tek haat suh sen ih tiim esuh setlak taatchung hali.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Miloong ah ih ngaakbaat rumta, “An sak ni juubaan pan bo ah!” “O ih tek haat chungko halu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Paatjaatheng esiit re kangno, sen loong ah paatja etan. <verse number="22" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lew 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:10">Rangph 17:10</ref></char></note> Moses ih sen loong asuh sen sah miwasah khoopkhan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">khoopkhan: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wosah khochok khoopkhan haat </char></note> baat tahan (Moses ih tah angka sente senwah loong ah phang banlamta), eno sen loong ah ih sen sah miwasah khoopkhan banlam ah Jehudi Naangtongsa hoon han. <verse number="23" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:9">Jn 5:9</ref></char></note>Moses Hootthe ah naktoom thih ah li anno sen sah khoopkhan banlam ah Jehudi Naangtongsa adi hoon han, ngah ih Naangtongsa mih wasiit deesiit raang ih tiimnge ih khadah lan? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Rangkhoh ni sok an ih dande han ah toi ih an, erah nang ebah amiisak doh dande theng.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Heh Kristo nih ah?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Jerusalem noksong mararah ih liita, &lt;&lt;ngoong awang loong ih tek haat chungha ah aa mih ah tam ah? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Sok thaak an! Heh noksong dung ni tiitbaatla, eno heh suh o ih uh tiim uh taliika! Neng loong ah ih Kristo ngeh amiisak jattam ih rumha? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Enoothong Kristo raaha doh bah o ih uh manawa ra hala ngeh ih tajatka ang ah. Eno seng loongtang ih jat ehi arah mih ah manawa ra hala.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Jisu ih Rangteenook ni nyootsootta adoh erongrongwah ih jengta, &lt;&lt;Amiimi ngah manawa ra halang sen ih jat tam ih hali? Nga chaan nawa ih tara rang. O ih ngah daapkaat halang, erah juuba ami ah. Sen ih heh ah tajatkan, <verse number="29" style="v"/>enoothong ngah ih bah jat ehang, tiimnge liidi ngah heh taangnawa nyia heh ih daapjah halang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Erah lih adi Jisu joot chung rumta, enoothong o ih uh tabuh rumta, tiimnge liidi heh saapoot ah maangthok ang taha. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Eno midung dowa mih hantek ih Jisu ah hanpi rum ano li rumta, &lt;&lt;Kristo raaha doh, arah mih reela nang ih ehan paatjaajih tamre ah?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Bante loong Jisu jootkhak kaat thuk rumta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Pharisi loong ah ih Jisu tiit miloong huwaan arah japchaat rumta, eno romwah phokhoh loong nyia neng ih bante loong marah marah ah Jisu jootkhak kaat thuk rumta. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Jisu ih liita, &lt;&lt;Sen damdoh chomroe saapoot ba boot roong tongthiin hang, eno nga daapkaatte ah jiinnah wang ang. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Sen ih ngah jamsok ehe, enoothong tajap tupri ang ah, tiimnge liidi ngah wanglang adoh sen tami wangran.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Jehudi ngoong awang loong ah neng jaachi ni roongwaan rumta, &lt;&lt;Seng ih lajaptup theng heh maako maakah ah? Seng mina songtong rumla Grik samnuthung adoh kah ano, Grik mina suh nyootsoot kaat suh tam liiha? <verse number="36" style="v"/>Heh ih liiha seng ih jam bah jamsok eh ih enoothong tachoh jamke ang ah, eno heh wangla adoh seng tajen wangke. Erah tiimjih suh liiha?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Roidong joisah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:36">Lew 23:36</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Thoontang nang eh hoondak rangwuuja ah kumatja saakaan ah angta, eno Jisu ah toonchap ano erongrongwah ih baattaan rumta, &lt;&lt;O mina joongle ih tiila nga taangnah wang han, eno <verse number="38" style="v"/>o ih hanpi halang erah ih jok theng. Rangteele ni liiha, ‘Roidong joisah ju ah heheh taangnawa dokjan ah.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Ijk 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Jek 14:8</ref> </char></note> <verse number="39" style="v"/>Erah langla Jisu ih Chiiala tiit ah baatta, o mina ih hanpi ah neng loong ah ih choh ah. Erah tokdi Chiiala ah maangkoh angta, mamah liidi heh rangka suh Jisu ah maang ngaaksaat angta.</para>
  <para style="s">Miloong ah daanmui rumta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Erah jengta ah japchaat rum ano miloong dung dowa mararah ih li rumta, &lt;&lt;A mih abah amiisak Khowah ju angkah!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Wahoh loong ah ih liita, &lt;&lt;Kristo ah heh!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Enoothong rukho ah ih liita, &lt;&lt;Kristo ah Galili nawa taraara! <verse number="42" style="v"/>Rangteele ni liiha Kristo ah Dewid Luuwang sutoom dowa ang ah eno Dewid songtongta hadaang adoh Betlehem nah tup ah.&gt;&gt; <verse number="43" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih Jisu thoidi miloong ah neng jaachi di pheephaak rumta. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Mararah ih jootkhak chung rumta, enoothong neng lak tapak rumta.</para>
  <para style="s">Jehudi Ngoong awang loong ih tahanpi rumta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Bante loong ngaakwang kohaano, Romwah phokhoh loong nyia Pharisite loong ih bancheng rumta, &lt;&lt;Sen loong ah ih mamah lasiitwan halan?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Bante loong ah ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;A mih jengla ah likhiik o uh tathaak mi jengka!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Sen nep, tam mokwaan tahan?&gt;&gt; Pharisite loong ah ih cheng rumta. <verse number="48" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Ngoong awang nyia Pharisite loong dowa wasiit taan heh hanpiite tup tam etan? <verse number="49" style="v"/>Erah miloong ah ih Moses hootthe ah tajat rumta, erah raangtaan ih neng loong ah Rangte tenkhat khui ni!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:1-2">Jn 3:1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Erah di Pharisi loongdung dowa Nikodima ngeh ih angta, erah mih ah jaakhodi Jisu sok ih wangta. Heh ih wahoh loong asuh liita, <verse number="51" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Seng hootthe jun dobah seng ih maangjap chaatke doh nyia heh reeraang maangjap tupke doh tami dut haatke.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Ese&lt;&lt; neng loong ah ih ngaak liita, &lt;&lt;an uh Galili nawa ba? Rangteele ah weh uno jat uh Galili nawa raaha rah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:52</char><char style="fq" closed="false">khowah o uh thaak rakmuh; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">le esiit ni liiha </char><char style="fq" closed="false">khowah erak eha. </char></note> khowah o uh amuh angta.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Minuh nusiit mih damdi roomjupta</para>
  <para style="p">[<verse number="1" style="v"/>Erah lih adi mirep neng nok ni wangta, eno Jisu ah Olip Kong ni wangta. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Erah saalih adi rangkhano di heh Rangteenook ni ngaakwangta. Mih loongtang ih heh ah kooktong rum kano, chooktong ano phang nyootsoot rumta. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hootthe nyootsootte loong nyia Pharisi loong ih minuh nusiit mih damdi roomjup arah nopsiit wanrum haano, neng loong ngathong ni chap thuk rumta. <verse number="4" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Nyootte&lt;&lt; neng loong ah ih Jisu suh baat rumta, &lt;&lt;arah nuh ah mih damdi roomjup arah japjoot dowa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Seng Hootthe ni Moses ih baatta erah likhiik minuh ah jong ih tekpat theng. Emah ang abah, an ih mamah li uh?&gt;&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lew 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Hodb 22:22-24</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Neng loong ah ih erah Jisu ah mat ih joot suh li rumta, jen deejoot esuh ngeh ah. Enoothong Jisu ah ngupbon ano heh laktiik ih hani raangta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Erah di chap rum ano Jisu suh chengroh ih rumta, eno toonchap ano neng loong asuh baat rumta, &lt;&lt;Sen loong dung dowa amadi tuk ih rangdah lataat dah kan mina ah ih jaakhothoon erah nuh ah jong ih phang pat an.&gt;&gt; <verse number="8" style="v"/>Erah lih adi kotbon ano hani we raangta. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Erah chaat rum ano, neng loong ah, wasiit wasiit eh, doksoon rumta, mihakthoon ah jaakhoh doksoonta, eno Jisu heh luulu thiinhaat rumta doh minuh ah heh reeni chaproh eta. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Jisu ah toonchap ano erah nuh asuh liita, &lt;&lt;Maako ih rumla? An dut haatte o bah uh daktong tam ela?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Wasiit uh amuh, chuupha,” minuh ah ih ngaakbaatta.</para>
  <para style="p">“Ese, emah ang abah ah,” Jisu ih ngaak liita, “Ngah ih uh tah dut haatra. Kah uh, enoothong nak kah dah uh.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Le hantek ni nyia ehak le raangta loong adi arah rum ah raangmuh (8:1-11); rukho ah langla Jn 21:24 diiba; rukho ah langla Luk 21:38 lih di; hewet esiit ni langla Jn 7:36 lidi</char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Mongrep raangtaan ih Jisu ah weephaak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:14">Mat 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">Jn 9:5</ref> </char>
    </note> Pharisi loong ah damdi Jisu we roongwaanta. &lt;&lt;Mongrep raang ih ngah ah weephaak,” Jisu ih liita. &lt;&lt;O mina ih nga lih phanhang heh jiinnah roidong weephaak ah je ah eno heh mabah uh laamang nah takhoomka.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 5:31">Jn 5:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Pharisi loong ah ih Jisu suh li rumta, &lt;&lt;Amadi an ih an teeteewah tiit baat hu; an jenglu jun ih tiim uh tadong jatthuk ri.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Emah tah angka” Jisu ih ngaakli rumta, &lt;&lt;ngah ih nga teewah tiit baat ang bah uh, ngah ih tiimjih baat hang erah amiisak tiit, tiimnge liidi ngah ih jat ehang ngah manawa ra halang nyia manah wang ang. Sen loong ih tajatkan ngah manawa ra halang nyia manah wang ang. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Sen ih mina hansi jun ih dande han; ngah ih bah o uh tadande kang. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Enoothong ngah ih emah mok ih thengtang bah, ngah ih dande hang ah epun ang thengta, tiimnge liidi adi nga luulu tah angkang; nga daapkaatte seng Wah nga damdi. <verse number="17" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Hodb 19:15</ref></char></note> Sen hootthe ni raangha haaki wanyi ah thungsiit doh jut abah, nengnyi ih tiim li ah erah ami ang ah. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ngah ih nga teewah tiit ah baat hang, eno nga daapkaatte seng Wah ih uh nga tiit baat ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;An Wah mani ah?&gt;&gt; Pharisi loong ah ih Jisu suh cheng rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">&lt;&lt;Sen loong ah ih seng Wah tajatkan ngah uh tajatri.&gt;&gt; Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta. &lt;&lt;Sen loong ah ih ngah jat he bah seng Wah uh jat etheng tan.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Arah jengkhaap ah Jisu ngunthiin theng nokkhok adi jengta, erah tokdi heh ih Rangteenook ni nyootsoot rumta. Eno heh jootkhak saapoot ah maangchang ang kano, o ih uh tajokhakta.</para>
  <para style="s">Ngah wanglang adoh sen tami wangran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Jisu ih neng loong asuh we liirumta, &lt;&lt;Ngah dokkhoom ih ang; sen ih ngah jamboi ehe, eno sen loong ah rangdah nah ti an. Ngah wanglang adoh sen tami wangkan.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih Jehudi ngoong awang loong ah ih liita, &lt;&lt;Jisu ih liiha heh wangla adoh seng tami wangke. Heh teeteewah tek haat tiit tambaat ha?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Sen loong ah arah mongrep khui nawa, eno ngah ah rangkhoh nawa raahang rah. Sen loong arah mongrep nawa, enoothong ngah arah mongrep nawa tah angkang. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih baatrum taha sen loong ah sen rangdah nah matti an. Sen loong ah ih ‘Ngah liiha ah Ngah,’” ah lahanpi kanbah sen rangdah nah matti an.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;An o ah?&gt;&gt; Neng ih Jisu suh cheng rumta. Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Phangbaat tang dowa ih tiim baat rumhala erah ju.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Phangbaat rum taha dowa ih tiim baat rumhala erah ju; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngah ih tiimbaat ih baat rumha?</char></note> <verse number="26" style="v"/>Sen suh ngah ih li theng rapne je ah, dut haat etheng uh eje. Enoothong ngah o ih daapkaat halang, heh juuba ami ah, eno heh jiin nawa tiim chaat hang erah juuba mongrep dowa mina loong asuh baat hang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Jisu ih Hewah tiit neng damdi roongwaanta ah tajat rumta. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih neng suh liita, “Mina Sah ah choomjoh andoh jat an, ‘Ngah liiha ah Ngah’ eno sen ih erah doh jat an nga chaan nawa ih tiim uh tare kang, seng Wah ih tiimjeng baat halang erah ba jeng lang. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Eno ngah o ih daapkaat halang heh ah nga damdi; nga luulu heh ih tathiinhaat rang, tiimnge liidi ngah ih saarookwet heh tenroon theng reelang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Jisu erah jengta ah japchaat rum ano miloong ah ih hanpi erumta.</para>
  <para style="s">Ami tiit ih an khoh puipangho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Eno Jisu ih heh suh hanpiite loong asuh baat rumta, &lt;&lt;Nga ih nyoot rumhala ah kap anbah, sen loong ah amiisak nga liphante ang an; <verse number="32" style="v"/>sen loong ah ih ami tiit ah ejat ete, eno amiisak rah ih sen loong ah doksiit ehan.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Seng loong abah Abraham sutom,” neng loong ah ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;eno seng loong ah mabah uh o dah uh tataat angke. Eno sen loong ah doksiit ehan ngeh ih jenglu ah tiimjih suh liihu?&gt;&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:9">Mat 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:8">Luk 3:8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Jisu ih neng loong asuh baat rumta, &lt;&lt;ngah ih sen loong asuh amiisak ih baat rumhala: O mina rangdah reeraangla erah mih ah rangdah suh heh dah ang ah. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Dah ah changtom nah roitang raang ih tah angka, enoothong heh sah ah ba roitang raang ih ang ah. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hesah rah ih maama pongwan toom ang ah ngeh li abah amiimiisak sen loong ah maama pongwan ejen ang ethuk han. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ngah ih jat ih rumhala sen loong ah Abraham sutoom. Rah bah uh sen ih nga tek haat chung han, tiimnge liidi ngah ih nyoot rumhala ah sen ih tabaam kap kan. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Seng Wah ih tiim noisok halang erah baat rumhala, enoothong sen suh sen wah ih marah baat halan ah re lan.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Neng ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Seng loong wah ah bah Abraham.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Jisu ih ngaakli rumta, &lt;&lt;Sen loong ah Abraham suh asah angtan bah,” &lt;&lt;sen loong ah heh reeta likhiik ih reetheng;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sen loong ah... heh reeta likhiik reetheng tan; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mararah le ni liiha</char><char style="fq" closed="false">sen ih emah... re anbah.</char></note> tan. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ngah ih bah seng Rangte jiin nawa chaat hang amiisak tiit ah ba baat hang, erabah uh sen loong ah ih nga tek haat chunghan. Abraham bah amah tareeta! <verse number="41" style="v"/>Sen bah sen wah mamah reeraangta erah likhiik ih re lan.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">&lt;&lt;Rangte heteewah luulu bah seng loong Wah,” miloong ah ih ngaakli rumta, &lt;&lt;eno seng loong ah heh sah mi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Jisu ih baat rumta, &lt;&lt;Rangte ah sen loong Wah angta bah ngah enook etheng tahe, tiimnge liidi ngah Rangte taangnawa ra halang. Nga chaan nawa ih ngah tara tahang, ngah bah heh ih daapkaat tahang. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Ngah ih tiimbaat rumhala erah mamah lajat ehan? Erah langla sen ih nga tiitkhaap ah lanook chaat thoidi angla. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Sen loong abah sen wah Hakhoh juubaan suh asah, eno sen loong ah sen wah tenthun jun di reeraang lan. Ephang dowa ih dook heh mitek haatte eno amiitiit ah mabah uh takapka, tiimnge liidi heh jiinni amiitiit ah amuh. Heh ih tiit hu baat ha langla, heh banlam mootkaat, tiimnge liidi heh ah ju ehuh eleek thoon nyia ehuh eleek thoontang waroop ah ju heh. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Enoothong ngah ih amiitiit ah baat rumhala, erah thoidi sen ih tahanpi ri. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Sen loong dung dowa ih ngah rangdah mih ngeh ih o ih jen noisok an? Ngah ih amiitiit ah baat rumhala bah, mamah lahanpi ehali? <verse number="47" style="v"/>O Rangte reenawa ra hala heh ih Rangte jengkhaap ah boichaat ih ah. Enoothong, sen loong ah Rangte reenawa lah ang thoidi, taboichaat kan ang ah.”</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Nyia Abraham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Neng loong ah ih Jisu suh chengta, &lt;&lt;Seng ih liihi an chiithih laakhah pan Samariate, epunjeng tam eli?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Ngah jiinni chiithih laakhah tajeeka, Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih seng Wah choomjoh hang, enoothong sen ih ngah tachoom jori. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nga rangka ah nga raang ih tajam kang. Enoothong erah rangka jamte ah wahoh eje eno heh ih nga mendoh dande ah. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Ngah ih ami baat rumhala; ngah ih nyootsoot hang ah o minah ih kap ah erabah mabah uh tatiika.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Jehudi loong ah ih Jisu suh li rumta, &lt;&lt;Seng ih jat ehi an chiithih laakhah pan! Abraham tek eta, Khowah loong uh tek eta, erabah uh an ih liihu an ih nyootsoot hu boichaatte ah mabah uh tatiika. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Seng loong wah Abraham bah tek eta; ngah Abraham nang ih elong ngeh ih nih li hu, emah tam thun hu? Eno khowah loong uh tek eta. Anteewah suh tiimjih samthun hu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih nga teewah mok choomjotang bah, erah choomchotang ah thaangmuh ang thengta. Nga choomjootte wasiit abah seng Wah—sen ih Rangte ngeh li han rah ah. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Sen ih mabah uh tathaak jatkan, ngah ih ba jat hang. Ngah ih tajatkang ngeh mok liitang bah sen likhiik ehuh eleek angtheng tang. Enoothong ngah ih jat ih angno, heh jengkhaap ah kap hang. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Sen loong wah Abraham bah nga kaat saapoot ah japtup suh eroon eta; eno heh ih japtup eta nyia eroon eta.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Neng ih Jisu suh li rumta, &lt;&lt;an amadi paangrook bangnga bot maang ang ko—eno Abraham japtup eto oh? <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:57 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abraham japtup tam etan? mararah ni liiha</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abraham ih japtup nih ih tahan?</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>“Ngah ih amiisak baat rumhala,” Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, “Abraham maang potsom di dook, ‘Ngah eje Angtang.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Eno erah li kano heh patsuh jong toonpi rumta, enoothong Jisu Rangteenook dowa hotsoon eta.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Edook dongtup warah Jisu ih deesiitta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Jisu tumkhoom ih adi, mih wasiit edook ih dongtup arah japtupta. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Heliphante loong ah ih cheng rumta, &lt;&lt;Nyootte, o rangdah thoidi arah mih ah edook eh dongtupta? Heh teewah tam henuwah rangdah thoidi dongta?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Heh mikdook ah heteewah rangdah nyia heh nuwah rangdah thoidi tah angka. Heh mikdookla abah Rangte chaan ah heh jun ih noisok suh ba angta. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Rang mathan ih wu ah nga daapkaatte wah mootkaat ah sen loong ah ih moot etheng jaatjaat ang ah; rangphe thok taha noobah o uh tami mokaka. <verse number="5" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Mat 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Jn 8:12</ref></char></note> Ngah mongrep nah tong pootdoh, mongrep raang ih ngah weephaak.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Erah jengta lidi, Jisu ih hah dowa paak ah toon ano heh took ih phota; eno edook mih adi hut, <verse number="7" style="v"/>eno Jisu ih baatta, &lt;&lt;Kah uh Siloom juutum adoh an the ah metkaat uh.&gt;&gt; (Siloom ah &lt;&lt;ekaatthuk&lt;&lt; suh liita.) Dookwah rah ih heh the ah metkaat kano heh mih ah dongsingta eno ngaakwangta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hekhung hetok jaatang nyia kunma warah japtupte loong ah chengmui rumta, &lt;&lt;A mih ah bitthaangte ah tanih angka?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mararah ih liita, &lt;&lt;Erah mih ah ju,” rukho loong ah ih liita, &lt;&lt;Heh tah angka; heh likhiik.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Erah thoidi heteewah ih baat rumta, &lt;&lt;Ngah laangbo aleh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Amadi an ih mamah mi tup hu leh?&gt;&gt; Miloong ah ih cheng rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Heh ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Mih wasiit Jisu ngeh angta, eno paak ah seemphoh ano nga mik ni hut tahang, heh ih baat tahang Siloom juutum adoh kah uno an the ah metkaat uh. Eno kah angno nga the met damdam ih dongtup tang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Heh mani ah leh?&gt;&gt; Miloong ah ih cheng rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">&lt;&lt;Tajatkang,” edook ah ih ngaakbaat rumta.</para>
  <para style="s">Pharisi loong ih ede eta ah toongte rumta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Erah lih adi miloong ah ih edook angta wah rah Pharisi loong taang ni siitkaat rumta. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Jisu ih paak ah hut ano dookwah deesiitta ja Jehudi naangtongsa angta. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Heh mih ah mamah mi siingta erah Pharisi loong ah ih edook asuh we cheng rumta. Heh ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Nga mik ni paak amasah hut tahang; Ngaathe ngaakhoh met kangno, amadi tup ehang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pharisi loong marah marah ih liita, &lt;&lt;A reeta mih abah Rangte re nawa bah tah angka, heh ih Jehudi Naangtongsa hootthe banlam ah takapka.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Enoothong, rukho loong ah ih liita, &lt;&lt;Rangdah mina ih a likhiik paatjaajih mamah mi re ah?&gt;&gt; Eno neng laktung ni daan jengmui rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih Pharisi loong ah ih erah mih asuh jaasiit we dopcheng rumta, &lt;&lt;an ih liihu heh ih an mik edook angtu ah singsiit taho—ese ju, enoobah an ih heh suh o ngeh ih liihu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Heh ih ngaakbaatta, heh ah &lt;&lt;khowah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Enoothong Jehudi ngoong awang loong ah ih heh edook ang arah amadi etup we eha ngeh ih hanpi suh tanook rumta, neng ih henuwah ah poon ano <verse number="19" style="v"/>amah maang chengcheng ah, &lt;&lt;Arah sen sah tam ah? Sen ih li han heh edook angta; enoobah, amadi heh ih mamah mi tup ha?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Heh nuwah ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Seng ih jat ih hi arah seng sah, nyia edook eh dongtup arah ngeh ah. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Enoothong seng ih tajatke amadi heh ih mamah mi tup ha, nyia edook ang arah o ih deesiitta. Heheh suh cheng anba; heh mihak tanih angka, heh teewah ih miibaat laang ejan!&gt;&gt; <verse number="22" style="v"/>Erah langla, henuwah ah Jehudi ngoong awang loong raacho ih jeng rumta, tiimnge liidi jaakhoni kakham rumta o ih Kristo ngeh ih li ano hanpi ah erah mih ah Jehudi rangsoomnok nawa dokphan etheng. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Erah thoidi henuwah ih li rumta, &lt;&lt;Heh mihak tanih angka; heh suh cheng anba ngeh ah!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Erah liidi neng ih heh nuh mong nawa edook eh tupta warah we ngaakpoon rumta, eno li rumta, &lt;&lt;Rangte ngathong nah thoomhoon uno amiitiit ah baat uh! Seng ih jat edi arah an deesiitte wah rah rangdah mina.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Ngah ih tajatkang heh ah rangdah mina elang tam tah lang koja,&gt;&gt; edook wah rah ih ngaakbaatta. &lt;&lt;Ngah ih jaatsiit baajat ang: Ngah edook angtang ah amadi dongtup ehang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Heh ih an tiimjih taho?&gt;&gt; neng ih cheng rumta. &lt;&lt;An edook ah heh ih mamah mi deesiit taho?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Ngah ih jaakhoni dook jen baat ih rum taha,” heh ih ngaakli rumta, &lt;&lt;eno sen ih tah boichaat tan. Sen ih tiim esuh we bootchaat suh li han? Sen uh, heliphante angsuh enook nih lan?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Neng ih thaangju kaanse lam ih li rumta, &lt;&lt;an baalek heliphante angkoju; seng bah Moses liphante. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Seng ih bah Rangte ih Moses suh baatta ah ba jat ih, enoothong, Jisu ah manawa ra taha erah botseh tajatke!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Eno edook angta deeta warah ih li rumta, &lt;&lt;Erabah epaatja etheng laang angla nih! Nga mikdook botseh deesiit tahang ah, heh manawa ra taha ah tawe jatkan nih! <verse number="31" style="v"/>Seng ih jaat ehi Rangte ih rangdah mina loong jeng ah taboichaat ka; heh ih heh jeng chaatchaat ih reete nyia heh choopjootte mina jeng ah ba chaat ah. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hah phangsongta dowa ih edook eh dongtup arah kaasiit arah mongrep ni tathaak chaatke.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Erah mih ah Rangte jiin nawa lara taha bah, tiim uh tala jenre thengtaaja.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Neng ih ngaakbaatta, &lt;&lt;Tup taho dowa ih an rangdah mong ni hak uno—an ih seng suh nyoot kachung hu?&gt;&gt; Eno neng ih Jehudi rangsoomnok nawa dokphan rumta.</para>
  <para style="s">Chiiala ni edook</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Jisu ih erah japchaatta adoh, dookwah rah japtup ano chengta, &lt;&lt;An ih Mina Sah ah hanpi tam ih hu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Erah wah rah ih ngaakbaatta, &lt;&lt;Chuupha, baat weehang heh ah o angla, enooba ngah ih heh jen hanpi ang!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaak baatta, &lt;&lt;An ih heh jen japtup etu, amadi marah an damdi waan hala erah warah ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Erah warah ih liita, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih hanpi ehang Teesu!&gt;&gt; Eno Jisu ngathong ni heh lakuh ni chooktongta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Jisu ih liita, &lt;&lt;Ngah arah mongrep ni dande esuh ra halang, edook ah ih tup toom ih ah nyia mikka ah edook toom ehoon ah ngeh ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Jisu reeni Pharisite mararah eje ang rumta, erah japchaat rum ano Jisu suh cheng rumta, &lt;&lt;Seng suh uh edook miimi tamli hali?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Sen loong ah edook lek angtan bah, sen loong tamoong thengtan; enoothong sen ih tup ehi chaang thoidi amadi uh sen emoong elan.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Saapriimte tiitthaak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Jisu ih liita, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih amiisak baat rumhala; o mina saap paakaawan lam ih lanop thang eh, lamhoh lam ih duuwangla abah, ehuh nyia meh putte ang ah. <verse number="2" style="v"/>O mina saap paakaawan lam ih nopla erabah Saapriimte. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Paakaalu sakte ih heh suh kaalu ah daap koha; saap ah ih heh men poon kano heh root ah chaat eha, eno riimkaatla. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Heh saap loong ah dokpoon ano, heh ngakhoh kala, eno heh saap loong ah heh root ah danjat rum ano helih helih ih karumla. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Saap loong ah ih wahoh lih taphan joka, erah nang ebah heh root ah lajatjoh rum kaano, erah mih reedowa moong soon erum ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Jisu ih a tiitthaak ah baat rumta, enoothong tim liiha ngeh ih neng loong ah ih tajat rumta.</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Saapriimte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Erah thoidi Jisu ih we liita, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih amiisak baatrum hala; saap raangtaan ih paakaawan ah ngah. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nga ngani o mathan ra taha abah loongtang ehuh nyia mih putte, enoothong saap loong ah ih neng jeng ah taboichaatta. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ngah juuba paakaawan ah. O mina nga jun ih nopwang ha erah ba pui ah; heh weewang weekah lengkhoom ano naam ah chophak ah. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ehuh abah hot hot suh, tek haat esuh nyia thet haat esuh ba wang hala. Enoothong ngah bah sen roidong toom choh an ngeh ih ra halang—sen roidong doh jirep ah chosuh ah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Saapriimte ese ah ngah, o ih saap loong raang ih roidong jen kotte warah ah. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lakniikte mina, o Saapriimte lah angka abah nyia heh saap laje kokaano, so wangha di moongsoon ela; eno saap loong ah so ih kum kano tiisoon ela. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lakniikte abah saap changte tah angka erah thoidi saap asuh lasootsaam thang ih moongsoonla. <verse number="14-15" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mat 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luk 10:22</ref></char></note> Saapriimte ese ah ngah. Seng Wah ih jat ih halang ngah ih seng Wah ah jat ehang, erah likhiik nga saap loong ah ngah ih jat ehang, neng ih uh jat ih halang. Eno neng raang ih nga roidong jen kot ih ang. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Arah saapnok adi lajeeka ah nga saap ehoh ni uh eje. Neng loong ah uh ngah ih adoh thoksiit etheng; neng loong ah ih nga root ah jat ih ah, eno Saapriimte wasiit damdoh eroom ih hoon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">eroom eh hoon ah; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mararah le ni liiha</char><char style="fq" closed="false">ang ih ah </char></note> ah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Seng Wah ih ngah enook ih halang, tiimnge liidi nga roidong kot suh tacho kang, ngah ih roidong we ngaak chosuh ah. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nga roidong ah nga jiin nawa o ih uh tajen ngeerang. Erah Nga thunghoon ih kohang. Ngah ih jen kot ih ang, adoleh jen ngaak thaang ih ang. Seng Wah ih erah reetheng ngeh ih baat halang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Erah jengkhaap ah thoidi Jehudi loong ah neng jaachi ni we daanmui rumta. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Neng loong laktung ni ehan ko ah ih liita, &lt;&lt;Heh damdi chiithih laakhah eje! Heh emok angla! Heh jeng ah tiim esuh boichaat han?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Enoothong wahoh loong ah ih liita, &lt;&lt;Hakhoh juubaan pan mina emah tami roongwaan ka! Hakhoh juubaan ih edook ah mamah ma mi kaasiit ah?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu jeng taboichaat rumta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Jerusalem ni, Rangteenook Rongraak Kuwaang ah hahook di kuh rumta. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Rangteenook adi Solomon Bulaang ngeh ih men rumta adi Jisu lengkhoomta, <verse number="24" style="v"/>adoh Jehudi loong ah kookrak ih khoonchap rum ano cheng rumta, &lt;&lt;seng loong ah amah nih moktong thuk he? Sen suh amiitiit ah baat he: Kristo ah an tam anglu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih sen suh jen baat ih rum taha, erabah uh sen ih tahanpi ri. Seng Wah chaan nawa ih tiimjaat reelang erah ih jat ih thuk halan Ngah o ah; <verse number="26" style="v"/>erabah uh sen loong ah nga saap lah ang thoidi tahanpi ri. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nga saap ih nga root ah chaat eha; neng loong ah ngah ih jat ehang, eno neng ih nga liphan rum halang. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Neng loong asuh ngah ih lathoon roidong kohang, eno neng mabah uh tatiika ang ah. Nga jiin nawa neng loong ah o ih uh tajen ngeerang. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Seng Wah ih tiim kohalang ah thoontang nang ih elongthoon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seng Wah ih marah kotahang ah eloongthoon; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mararah le ni liiha </char><char style="fq" closed="false">seng Wah, o angla rah ih ngasuh kotahang, ah elongthoon.</char></note> eno seng Wah lak nawa o ih uh tajen ngeeka. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Sek Soowah ah esiit.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Erah jeng kano miloong ah ih pat esuh jong taatwe toon rumta. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Jisu ih li rumta, &lt;&lt;Seng Wah ih reethuk halang ah sen loong pandi mootse kaatse ah mokalang; erah thoidi jong ih patsuh tamli hali?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lew 24:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Neng loong ah ih ngaakli rumta, &lt;&lt;an mootse kaatse reethoi di jong ih patsuh tali ke, enoothong an ih Rangte thaangju hu, an mina tanih angko an teewah suh Rangte ngeh ih thun hu!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 82:6">Rsb 82:6</ref> </char>
    </note> Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Sen hootthe ni Rangte ih emah liiha, ‘sen loong ah rangte.’ <verse number="35" style="v"/>Seng ih jat ehi leedap ni tiimjih liiha erah saarookwet raang ih amiisak; eno Rangte ih erah mina loong asuh rangte ngeh liita, erah mina loong asuh heh tiitkhaap ah kota. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ngah bah, seng Wah ih danje hang no arah mongrep adi kaat thuk tahang. Eno, ngah ih Rangte Sah li kangno, Rangte thaangju hu ngeh sen ih mamah mi li he? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Eno bah nak hanpi he, seng Wah ih jamha jun ih lare kangbah ah. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ngah lahanpi ri bah uh, ngah reelang loong ah baalah hanpi an, jaasiitdoh sen loong ah ih jat toom ih an suh ah, seng Wah ah nga damdi adoleh ngah seng Wah damdi ngeh ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Miloong ah ih Jisu jootkhak suh taatwe chung rumta, enoothong neng lak nawa doksoon ekata.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:28">Jn 1:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Joon ih juutem rumta Jordan ju lam ih we ngaak daansoon ano, erah ni tong kata. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Miloong ah heh reeni hantek thok rum taha. Neng loong ah ih liita, &lt;&lt;Joon ih bah paatjaajih tareeta, &lt;&lt;enoothong heh ih a mih tiit baatta ah amiisak ih baatta.&gt;&gt; <verse number="42" style="v"/>Eno erah ni mina hantek ih hanpi rumta.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lajaras tiita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:38">Luk 10:38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:39">39</ref></char>
    </note> Lajaras ngeh ih mih wasiit angta ah sat eta. Heh Bithani ni tongte angta, Bithani ah Meeri nyia heh no Martha tongta samthung angta. (<verse number="2" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:3">Jn 12:3</ref></char></note>Teesu lah ni phontum ih lok ano heh khoroon ih hut haatte ah Meeri angta; eno khoisatte Lajaras ah heh no angta.) <verse number="3" style="v"/>Heh jongsah anyi ih Jisu suh maatbaat nyuuta: &lt;&lt;Teesu an joonte abah sat ela.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Jisu ih erah chaat ano, liita, &lt;&lt;Lajaras khoisat ah tek esuh bah tabaam angka; erabah Rangte rangka suh ba angla, eno Rangte Sah rangka lampo ah erah ang ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Martha nyi soonah nyia nengnyi no Lajaras ah Jisu moongnook angjom rumta. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lajaras khoisat ah chaat abah uh, heh tongta hah adi saanyi boot daktong thiinta <verse number="7" style="v"/>Eno Jisu ih heliphante loong asuh liita, &lt;&lt;Judia nah ngaakwang ih.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Nyootte,&gt;&gt; heliphante loong ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Erah hah adi Jehudi loong ih jong ih taatpat taho ah halowah tah angla; eno erah ni ngaakkaat chung hu oh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Rangwuusiit di asih koonta nyi tanih angka? Erah raang ih rangwu di khoomte ah tabanbotka, tiimnge liidi heh ih mongrep dowa weephaak ah tup eha. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Enoothong, rangphe doh weephaak mudoh khoom abah banbot ih ah.&gt;&gt; <verse number="11" style="v"/>Jisu erah jeng ano jangbaatkaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Seng joonte Lajaras bah mokjup ela, eno ngah kah angno saatsiit ih kah ang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Heliphante loong ah ih ngaakli rumta, &lt;&lt;Teesu, heh mokjup ela bah, ede ih ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Jisu ih Lajaras jup ela liita ah tek asuh liita, enoothong neng ih mokjup tiit baat ha ngeh ih mok samthun rumta. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih Jisu ih saasa ih dokbaat rumta, Lajaras ah tek ela, <verse number="15" style="v"/>enoothong ngah mudi emah angla thoidi sen loong raang ih eroon elang, erah thoidoh ba sen ih kok hanpi an. Heh jiinnah wang ih.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Thomas (khaangpeh ngeh ih men rumta) ih Jisu liphante wahoh loong asuh liita, &lt;&lt;Nyootte damdoh seng loong ah wakwang ih, seng loong ah uh heh damdoh toom roongti wang ih!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ngaaksaat nyia Roidong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Jisu thokta adi, Lajaras ah sa baji ngani dook bengkaat arah japtup wangta. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Jerusalem ah phaloong jom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Phaloong: Kilometre ah suh liiha</char></note> nang ih haniik angta, <verse number="19" style="v"/>Martha nyia Meeri no tek kano Jehudi nok hah loong ah nengnyi huudiip ra rumtaha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Martha ih Jisu wang ah japchaat ano heh damdi chomui suh dokkhoom kata, enoothong Meeri ah nok ni tangtongta. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Martha ih Jisu suh liita, &lt;&lt;Teesu, an aanah angtu bah, nga no ah tatek thengta! <verse number="22" style="v"/>Enoothong ngah ih jat ehang, an ih amadoh Rangte jiin nawa tiim suh uh erah kot eho.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Jisu ih baatta, &lt;&lt;An no tek nawa we ngaaksaat ih ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Martha we ngaakjengta, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih jaat ehang&lt;&lt; saathoon doh &lt;&lt;heh ngaaksaat ih ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Jisu ih heh suh baatta, &lt;&lt;Ngah tek nawa ngaaksaattte nyia roidong, o ih ngah hanpi halang, erah mih ah etek ih abah uh ething ang ah; <verse number="26" style="v"/>eno o ih ngah hanpi hangno thing tongla erah mabah uh tatiika. Arah tiit ah hanpi tam ih hu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;En Teesu!&gt;&gt; Martha ih ngaakbaatta. &lt;&lt;Ngah ih hanpi ehala, arah mongrep adi kaatte, Rangte Sah Kristo ah anju.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu huuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Maratha ih erah baat lih ni, heh nah Meeri jiinni hotsu ih ngaakwang ano poonwangta, &lt;&lt;Nyootte ah bah ani,” eno heh ih &lt;&lt;an jam halu.&gt;&gt; <verse number="29" style="v"/>Meeri ih erah chaat ano, Jisu taang ni chomui suh seek ih saatsoon kata. <verse number="30" style="v"/>(Jisu erah hadaang adi maangthok angta, maradi Maratha chomui kata erah di thoktong roh eta.) <verse number="31" style="v"/>Meeri ah seek ih saatsoon kano, henok ni heh huudiipte khoontongta Jehudi loong ah ih mokthun rumta mangbeng ni hu kala ngeh ah, eno helilih ih phanjoh karumta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Meeri ah Jisu reeni thok ano, heh laan japtup roh eta, eno heh lakuh ni chooktong kata. Meeri ih liita, &lt;&lt;Teesu&lt;&lt; &lt;&lt;an anah angtu bah nga no ah tatek thengta!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Jisu ih Meeri nyia heh damdi roongkaatte, miloong hu ah tup ano, heh rapne ih thungthita. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Jisu ih cheng rumta, &lt;&lt;Heh mani bengkaat tan?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Miloong ah ih baat rumta, &lt;&lt;Teesu, Sok ra thaak ho.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Jisu ah ehu eta. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Miloong ah ih li rumta, &lt;&lt;Taat sok thaak an, heh ih tiimthan minchanha!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Enoothong Neng dung dowa mararah ih liita, &lt;&lt;Heh ih edook nep tanih kaasiitta, tatam angka? Lajaras ah tek nawa taba jentang ka?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Lajaras tek nawa ngaakthingta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Jisu we thungthih ano mangbeng ko ih kata, mangbenglu ah jonglo ih kepta. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Jisu ih baat rumta, &lt;&lt;Jong ah dokloong an!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Martha, etek eta jongsah rah ih liita, &lt;&lt;Nam bah nam ebaat ah Teesu. Erah bengta dowa ih sa baji dook angla!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Eno Jisu ih Martha suh liita, &lt;&lt;hanpi ih ubah Rangte chaan aphaan ah tup ih uh ngeh ih tanih baat taha?&gt;&gt; <verse number="41" style="v"/>Neng loong ah ih jong ah dokloong rumta. Jisu rangko ih toonsokwan ano jengta, &lt;&lt;Ewah, nga rangsoom ah chaat raangtaan ih lakookmi li hala. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ngah ih jaat ehang an ih saarookwet ih boichaat halang, enoothong arah liihang abah, aradi lomkhoon hala miloong ah ih, an ih daapkaat tahang ngeh ih toom hanpi rumhang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Erah jengta lih adi, Jisu ih erongwah ih riipoonta, &lt;&lt;Lajaras, dokkhoom ho!&gt;&gt; <verse number="44" style="v"/>Eno dokkhoom taha, helak helah mang loop nyuh ih dekchoi nyia hethe hekhoh nyuh ih dek arah, dokkhoom taha. Jisu ih baat rumta, &lt;&lt;Nyuh ah jaahaat an,” eno &lt;&lt;Toomwang ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu khumtan rumta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 2:1-5">Mat 2:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Mk 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luk 22:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Meeri taang ni dongwangte mih hantek ih, Jisu tiimjih reeraangta ah tup rum ano heh ah hanpi ih rumta. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Enoothong mararah Pharisi loong jiinni ngaakwang rum ano Jisu reeraangta loong ah baatwan rumta. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Erah thoidi Pharisi nok hah nyia romwah phokhoh loong ah Ngoong awang loong damdi chothum rum ano roongwaan rumta, &lt;&lt;Seng ih tiimjih ih?&gt;&gt; Mih paatjaajih reeraangla loong ah sok thaak an! <verse number="48" style="v"/>Seng ih emah jaatjaat ih reeraang thuk ebah, warep ih hanpiite angrumla, eno Room nok hah ngoong awang loong ih li ih baat he, eno seng Rangteenook nyia seng deek sengkaan uh thet haat ete ang hali!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Neng changdi wasiit, heh men ah Kaiphas angta, erah paang adi heh Romwah Phokhothoon angta, eno heh ih li rumta, &lt;&lt;Sen mamah jen ngakthak lan! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Sen ih tatam samthun kan deek akaan pan ih matnang ih noksong raangtaan ih wasiit rooptiila ah ese ang ah ngeh ah!&gt;&gt; <verse number="51" style="v"/>Kaiphas ah hethung nawa ih tajengta, erah paang adi Romwah Phokhothoon ang kano, Jehudi noksong raang ih Jisu roopti ah ngeh ih chiilam laalam ni banjat eta, <verse number="52" style="v"/>eno neng loong raangtaan luulu tah angka, Rangte suh asah mathan phaang jaangta erah loong ah phunsiit saksiit ih khoonsiit suh nep angta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Erah sa dowa ih Jehudi ngoong awang loong ah ih Jisu tek haat suh chung rumta. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Erah thoidi Judia ni Jisu wuusa ni tanaan tupkhoomta, eno erah hah dowa doksoon ano, phisaang hah re dowa Ephraim samnuh ni heliphante loong damdi tong kata.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Khopi Kuwaang lang nanah ang kano, miloong ah neng hah nawa Jerusalem ni Kuwaang maangdi khojoop karumta. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Neng ih Jisu jamsok rumta, eno neng loong ah Rangteenook ni thutthe rum adi, neng neng chengmui rumta, &lt;&lt;Sen ih tiimjih thun han?&gt;&gt; Jisu ah kuwaang adoh tajaatjaat tam wangra?&gt;&gt; <verse number="57" style="v"/>Romwah phokhoh nyia Pharisi loong ih baat rumta, o ih Jisu japtup ah, heh ih chobaat etheng, neng ih jootkhak esuh ah.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu Bithani ni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mk 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Khopi Kuwaang sa arok ngani, Jisu Bithani ni kata, erah hah ah heh ih tek nawa ngaaksaat siitta Lajaras hadaang angta. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Neng loong ah ih Jisu raangtaan ih rangja phaksat songwaang rumta, erah di Martha ih roong sokboita; neng dung dowa Lajaras ah teebun reeni Jisu damdi roongtongta. <verse number="3" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37">Luk 7:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 7:38">38</ref></char></note>Eno Meeri ih etumjaat nard banglak nawa hoon arah thuuthom thaangchaan thaang phontum ah piiwan haano Jisu lah ni lokwan taha, eno heh khoroon ih hut haatta. Phontum ah nokmong ni tummangmang ih tumwangta. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Eno heliphante dung dowa wasiit, Judas Iskirot-Jisu mokwaante ah ih liita. <verse number="5" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Erah than thaangchaan phontum ah ngunkholok chaajom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ngunkholok: 6:7 ah soktheng</char></note> doh sang ano changthih loong asuh ngun ah mamah lapheekoh eha?&gt;&gt; <verse number="6" style="v"/>Heh erah jengta ah changthih minchan ih tajengta, heh ehuh ang ah angno jengta. Ngunkhaak ah heh ih huita, eno erah dowa heh ih kamaakta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Eno Jisu ih liita, &lt;&lt;Meeri ah nak paklak an heh luulu thiinhaat an! Phontum ah nga mangbeng raang ih toomthiin ah. <verse number="8" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Hodb 15:11</ref></char></note>Changthih abah saarookwet ih sen damdoh ang ha, enoothong ngah ah saarookwet sen damdoh tatongrang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Lajaras khumtan rumta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mih hantek ih Jisu Bithani ni ngeh japchaat rumta, erah thoidi Jisu jamboi luulu la angthang ih, Jisu ih tek nawa ngaakthingta Lajaras nep tup suh wang rumta. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Romwah phokhoh loong ah ih Lajaras nep tek haat suh chung rumta, <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lajaras ngaaksaat thoidi Jehudi loong ah ih ngoong awang jeng laboichaat thang ih Jisu reeni wangleh heh ah hanpi rumta.</para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem ni ruurangrang ih wangta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Erah saalih adi Khopi Kuwaang ni wangte miloong ah ih Jisu Jerusalem ni wang ah japchaat rumta. <verse number="13" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Rsb 118:25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref> </char></note> Erah thoidi miloong ah paam bangmong ah pi rum ano chomui karumta, eno riirumta, &lt;&lt;Rangte rangphoong an! O Teesu mendi ra hala heh suh Rangte ih romse tamkoh ah! Rangte ih Ijirel Luuwang suh romseetam koh ah!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Rangteele ni raangha likhiik, Jisu ih moktoh ah japtup ano heh sakkhoh ni duutong ano kata,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Jek 9:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note> &lt;&lt;Jaion samnuthung dowa mina loong ah nakcho an!</para>
  <para style="q1">Sen Luuwang arah ra hala,</para>
  <para style="q2">moktoh khoni ra hala.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Erah tokdi heliphante loong ah ih tiim suh liiha ngeh ih tajat rumta; enoothong Jisu ah dong rangka kano ba; samthun rumta rangteele ni liiha ah heh suh liiha eno neng loong ah heh raangtaan mokah rumla ngeh ah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mang beng nawa Jisu ih Lajaras tekchoi dokpoon ano ngaakthing thukta tupte miloong ah ih noongrep ni tumbaat kaat rumta. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Paatjaajih reeraang kano miloong ah chomui wang rumta. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pharisi loong ah nengneng laktung di roongwaan rumta, &lt;&lt;sok thaak an, seng ih tiim uh tami eke! Arah mongrep dowa mina loong ah ih helih tola phan rumha!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Grik mina mararah ih Jisu jam rumta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kuwaang mong adi Jerusalem ni rangsoom wangrum ta dung adi Grik nok hah mararah eje angta. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Neng loong ah Philip jiinni wang rumta (heh Galili nawa Bethsaida nok hah angta), neng loong ah ih heh suh li rumta, &lt;&lt;Chuupha, seng Jisu tup suh liihi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Philip ih Andriu suh baatwan ano nengnyi wanyiinyi Jisu suh baatwan nyuuta. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Eno Jisu ih nengnyi suh ngaakbaat nyuuta, &lt;&lt;Mina Sah rangka saapoot ah amadi thok ehala. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ngah ih amiisak baat rumhala; raanteh ah hah nah wen ano latek thukka bah raanteh esiit laklak ang ah. Raanteh ah tek ih taano ba, hantektek ih dong tiik ah. <verse number="25" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mk 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luk 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref></char></note> O mina ih heh teewah roidong asuh mongmah ah erah mina ah ih mat haat ih ah; arah mongrep adoh o mina ih heh roidong ah lathunka mina rah ih mabah uh lathoonka roidong ah ban thiinha. <verse number="26" style="v"/>O mina ih nga mootkaat suh enook e ah, heh nga lih jaatjaat phanjih, eno ba nga laksuh ah ngah maadoh angang heh uh erah doh roong angha. Eno nga mootkaat ah o kah ah erah seng Wah ih soomtu ih ah.</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ih heh tektiit baatta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Amadi ngah mong rapne saamlang—eno ngah ih tiimjih li ang? Ngah ih emah tamli ang, ‘Ewah, nga chamchoh saapoot ah nakthok thukwe ho? Enoothong ngah erah raangtaan ih ra tahang—chamnaang saapoot ah chosuh ah. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ewah, an men rangkajih ju toom ang ah!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Eno rang ni jeng arah chaatta, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih heh rangka ah thoksiit halang, eno bolam uh emamah ih boot rangka thuk ang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Erah di khoonchap rumta miloong ah ih japchaat ih rumta, eno mararah ih liita ranghuula, mararah ih liita, &lt;&lt;Rangsah heh damdi roongwaan la!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Enoothong Jisu ih baat rumta, &lt;&lt;Erah jengla ah nga raang ih tah angka, erah sen loong raang ih jengla. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Amadi, arah mongrep dande saapoot ah thok ehala, arah mongrep pante loong ah datsiit ih ah. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Eno, arah hah dowa ngah toonjoh hangdoh loongtang nga reenah thoksiit rumhang.&gt;&gt; (<verse number="33" style="v"/>Jisu erah jengta ah heh mamah ih ti ah erah tiit ah baatta.)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Miloong ah ih liita, &lt;&lt;Seng Hootthe ih liiha Kristo ah saarootwet raang ih ething tong ah. Eno, sen ih, Mina Sah ah toonjoot jaatjaat ih ah ngeh ih mamah ih miili han?&gt;&gt; Mina Sah rah o ah?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Rsb 110:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:25">Ijk 37:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dan 7:14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Weephaak ah sen loong damdoh chomroe ba boot waktong ha. Erah raangtaan ih, weephaakla tok adoh sen khoom roh ih an laamang nah phokhoom an; tiimnge liidi laamang ni khoomte ih tajatka heh maani kala ngeh ah. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih, weephaak ah hanpi ih an, weephaak mina toom ang an.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Miloong ah ih tahanpi rumta</para>
  <para style="p">Erah baat rumta lidi, Jisu ah neng loong reenawa doksoon kah ano hutong kata. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Miloong ah pandi Jisu ih paatjaajih loong ah taat noisok rum abah uh, tahanpi rumta, <verse number="38" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa 53:1</ref></char></note>erah raangtaan ih Isaia khowah jengta ah amiisak ih toom ang raaha ngeh ah:</para>
  <para style="p">&lt;&lt;Teesu, seng ih baat hi tiitkhaap ah o ih hanpi ah?</para>
  <para style="p">Teesu ih, hechaan hephaan ah o suh noisok ha?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Eno, neng loong ih tami hanpi rumta, Isaia khowah ih uh erah ah baatta,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:10">Isa 6:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>&lt;&lt;Rangte ih neng mik dookthuk ah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nengthung nengtak tajang thukka ang ah,</para>
  <para style="q1">tiimnge liidi neng mik ih naktoom tup ah,</para>
  <para style="q2">neng thung ih na toom jat ah ngeh ah,</para>
  <para style="q2">eno nga reenah uh deesiit esuh naktoom</para>
  <para style="q2">wang rumha, Rangte ih liita.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Erah Isaia jengta, Jisu rangka ah tup ano heh tiit ah baatta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Erabah uh, Jehudi ngoong awang loong ih Jisu ah hanpi erumta, enoothong Pharisi loong ih Jehudi rangsoomnok nawa dokphan raacho ih wuusa ni tanaan waan rumta. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Eno neng loong ah ih Rangte ih gu nang ih mina ih gu ah jam rumta.</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Jengkhaap jun ih dande ah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Jisu ih erongwah ih riibaat rumta, &lt;&lt;O mina ih ngah hanpi rum halang, erah loong ah ih nga luulu tahanpi rumrang enoothong nga daapkaatte rah uh hanpi ih rumha. <verse number="45" style="v"/>O mina ih ngah tup ih halang, ngah daapkaatte ah uh etup eha. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Ngah arah mongrep adi weephaak likhiik ih ra tahang, nga hanpiite loong ah laamang mong nah naktoom tong rum ah ngeh ah. <verse number="47" style="v"/>O mina ih nga tiitkhaap ah chaat ano lakapka bah, ngah ih heh tadande kang. Ngah mongrep dande tara rang, puipang esuh ra tahang. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Enoothong o mina ih nga jeng lakapka nyia nga tiit ah edaan ih ah, heh dande wahoh wasiit je ah. Ngah jenglang jengkhaap ah ih rangthoon doh heh dande ah! <verse number="49" style="v"/>Arah amiisak tiit baat hang, tiimnge liidi nga chaan nawa ih tajeng kang, ngah daapkaatte seng Wah ih emah ih jeng theng ngeh ih baat halang ah ba jenglang. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Ngah ih jat ehang heh jengdang ah ih lathoon roidong koh ah. Erah raangtaan ih ngah ih tiim liihang, erah seng Wah ih baat halang jeng ah baat hang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu ih heliphante loong lah tiihaatta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Erah sa ah Khopui Kuwaang sa rangkhah ang ah liidoh angta. Jisu ih jat eta heh mongrep dowa Hewah reenah toon soonwang suh saapoot ah thok ehala. Jisu ih mongrep dowa heh mina loong ah saarookwet minchan rumta, eno rangkuh maang thoonthoon ih minchan rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Jisu nyia heliphante loong ih rangja phaaksat sah rumta. Erah di dook Hakhoh juubaan ih Simon Iskariot sah Judas tenthun ni Jisu jootkot suh jen nop ih thukta.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hakhoh luuwang... Jisu jootkot; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hakhoh luuwang ih, Simon Iskirot sah, Judas Iskirot ih jootkot etheng ngeh ih jen samthun eta</char></note> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Jisu ih jat eta Hewah ih jirep chaan aphaan ah heh suh koha, eno heh ih jat eta heh Rangte reenawa ra taha eno Rangte jiinnah we ngaakwang ah ngeh ah. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan phaksat sah rumta teebun dowa Jisu toonchap ano rangkhoni kapta samsong ah khookthiin ano, nyusah ah heh room ni toondekta. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Eno joong ah tek adi ke ano heliphante loong lah ah tiihatta eno heh room dowa nyusah rah ih hook hut rumta. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Jisu ah Simon Pitar reeni kaat kano chengta, &lt;&lt;Teesu, nga lah uh tiihaat nih ehang?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaatta, &lt;&lt;amadoh ngah ih tiim ehang tajatko, enoothong linah dongjat uh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pitar ih liita, &lt;&lt;Tiimtok doh uh nga lah bah nak tiihaat hang!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Jisu ih ngaak liita, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih an lah ah latiihaat raabah,” &lt;&lt;an nga liphante takah angko.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Simon Pitar ih ngaakbaatta, &lt;&lt;Teesu, enoobah nga lah luulu nak tiihaat hang! Nga khoh nyia nga lak nep chotchaat hang!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Jisu ih liita, &lt;&lt;O mina ih heh sak saachot choi abah esa lakah chot theng, heh lah luulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mararah le ni tajeeka</char><char style="fq" closed="false">heh lah luulu liiha.</char></note> ba tiihaat theng. Sen thoontang esa—wasiit ah ba.&gt;&gt; (<verse number="11" style="v"/>Jisu ih heh jootkotte ah jen jat eta; erah thoidi jengta, &lt;&lt;Sen loongtang esa, wasiit ah ba.&gt;&gt;)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:27">Luk 22:27</ref> </char>
    </note> Jisu ih neng lah ah jen tiihaat rum ano heh samsong ah we toonsongta eno teebun adi ngaaktong wangta. Jisu ih cheng rumta, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih sen raangtaan ih tiimjih etang jat tam ih tan?&gt;&gt; <verse number="13" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Sen ih ngasuh nyootte nyia Teesu li hali, punjeng elan, tiimnge liidi ngah emah ju. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Sen Teesu nyia Nyootte ang ang bah uh ngah ih sen lah tiihaat rumhala. Erah raangtaan ih sen uh sen lah ah emamah tiihaatmui theng. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ngah ih sen loong asuh jengthaak nyootsoot rumhala, seng uh emamah angtheng ngeh ah. <verse number="16" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">Jn 15:20</ref></char></note> Sen loong asuh amiisak tiit ah baat rumhala: Heh Teesu nang ih o dah uh elong tah angka, adoleh tiitkhaap baat kaatte ah heh daapkaat nang ih elong tami angka. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Amadi sen ih ami tiit ah jat ehan, emamah ih banreeraang anbah, sen tiimthan tenroon ang an!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Rsb 41:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note> &lt;&lt;Sen loongtang tiit ngah ih tabaat kang; o danje hang ah ngah ih jat ehang. Enoothong rangteele ni liiha ah thok jaatjaat eha, erah di emah liiha, o mina nga damdoh roong phaksah ha erah mih ah nga siikhaamte ih hoon ah. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Erah maang angkaadi sen loong asuh baat rumhala, rangthoon doh emah ang adoh sen ih hanpi ih an ‘Ngah Liiha ah Ngah’. <verse number="20" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mk 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luk 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">10:16</ref></char></note> Ngah ih amiisak tiit ah baat rumhala; ngah ih daapkaat lang mih ah o ih lambanchoh ah erah nga lambanchoh halang, adoleh o ih nga lam bantho halang erah nga daapkaatte wah lam bantho ha.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ih heh jootkot banjat eta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mat 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mk 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Erah jeng lidi Jisu rapne ih mongsaam ano wuusaani dongjengta, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih amiisak tiit baat rumhala; sen loong dung dowa wasiit ih ngah jokoh he.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Heliphante loong ah neng neng sokmui rum ano paatti rumta, o suh liiha ngeh ah. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Heliphante dung dowa Jisu mongnook warah Jisu reeni tongta. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Simon Pitar ih helak ah moot ano erah wah rah suh chengta, &lt;&lt;Erah o asuh li hali chengthaak uh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Eno heliphante ah Jisu reeni tiittong ano chengta, &lt;&lt;Teesu erah o ang weeli?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaatta, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih baanlo ah khu adoh tem angno koh ang; erah mih ah ang ah.&gt;&gt; Eno Jisu ih baanlo chep ah luptem ano Simon Iskariot sah, Judas suh kota. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Baanlo thaang damdam Soitaan ah Judas sak ni noptongta. Eno Jisu ih Judas suh baatta, an tiim reetheng ah kharok ih re uh!&gt;&gt; <verse number="28" style="v"/>Teebun ni roongtongte heliphante wahoh loong ah ih o ih uh tajatta Jisu ih heh suh tiim esuh emah baatta ngeh ah. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Heliphante loong ih mok samthun rumta, Judas ah ngun thiinte ang kano Kuwaang raang ih phaksat riikkaat hebaat ha erah lah angka changthih noodek suh kot hebaat ha ngeh ah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Erah kota baanlo ah thaangpi ano Judas ah doksoon ekata. Erah tokdi rangnak angta.</para>
  <para style="s">Jengdang Ena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Judas ah doksoon kaat kano Jisu ih liita, &lt;&lt;Amadi Mina Sah rangka ah dongjat thuk ha, Rangte rangka ah heh jun ih dongjat thuk ha. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Eno Rangte rangka ah Hesah jun ih choh abah, Mina Sah heh ih rangka ha ah dongjat thuk ah, eno erah kharok ih choomjoh ah. <verse number="33" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:34">Jn 7:34</ref></char></note>Ngaasuh ngaasah loong, ngah sen damdoh saatang tah roongtong rang. Sen ih ngah jamboi ih he, enoothong Jehudi nok hah ngoong awang loong suh baattang ah likhiik, ‘Ngah maako wanglang erah doh sen tami wangran.’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Eno ngah ih sen suh jengdang ena koh rumhala; sen loong jaachi nah minchanmui etheng. Ngah ih sen loong minchan rumhala ah likhiik sen uh minchanmui etheng.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:12">Jn 15:12</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1Jn 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2Jn 5</ref></char></note> <verse number="35" style="v"/>Sen jaachi nah minchanmui ih anbah warep ih erah doh jat ah, sen loong ah nga liphante ngeh ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ih Pitar leek tiit banbaatta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;An manah wang uh, Teesu?&gt;&gt; Simon Pitar ih chengta.</para>
  <para style="p">Jisu ih ngaakbaatta, &lt;&lt;Amadoh an ih nga lih tajen phanrang,&gt;&gt; enoothong liwang nah nga lih jen phan ehang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Teesu, amadoh tiimnge ih an lih lajen phan ah?&gt;&gt; Pitar ih ngaak chengta, &lt;&lt;Ngabah an raangtaan ih tek suh banban ih tonglang!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaak liita, &lt;&lt;Amiisak nga raang ih teksuh banban tam tonglu? Ngah ih amiisak tiit baat hala; woh maang weeka doh an jaajom leek uh tajatkang ngeh ah.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Hewah jiinni wang suh lampo ah Jisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Heliphante loong asuh Jisu ih baat rumta, &lt;&lt;Nak thungthih an nyia naksootsaam an,&lt;&lt;Rangte nyia ngah ba hanpi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hanpi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hanpi an.</char></note> he. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Seng Wah nok ni nokkhok hantek je ah, erah raangtaan ih ngah sen tongtheng ban khookham wanglang. Emah lah ang dobah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Emah lah ang dobah; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Seng Wah nok ni nokkhok hantek je ah; emah lah ang dobah sen raangtaan khookham wanglang ngeh ih tamma baat theng rum taha?</char></note> sen suh tabaat theng rum taha. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Eno, sen tongtheng jen khookham tangno, sen loong ah nga reenah toonsiit wansuh we ngaakrak ehang. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Sen ih jat ehan ngah wanglang lam ah maako wangla ih ah.&gt;&gt; <verse number="5" style="v"/>Thomas ih Jisu suh chengta, &lt;&lt;Teesu, an maako wanglu ah botseh lajatke ah; eno erah nah thoktheng lam ah mamah ih jat ih?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;Ngah juuba lampo, amiisak nyia roidong; seng Wah jiinnah o uh tajen wangka, nga jun ih luulu jen wang ah. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Jisu ih li rumta, Amadi sen ih ngah jat ih hali,&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:7</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Amadi ngah jat ih hala sen ih jat ih an; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mararah le ni</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sen ih jat ih tahe bah sen ih jat ih theng tahe.</char></note> &lt;&lt;seng Wah uh jat ih an, eno amah dowa ih heh uh jat ih han tup uh tup ih han.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Philip ih Jisu suh liita, &lt;&lt;Teesu, seng loong asuh seng Wah ah baat kohe; erah jamhi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaatta, &lt;&lt;Philip, sen loong damdi ngah rathan roongtong halang ah; amadi uh ngah o ah maang nih jat rang?&gt;&gt; O mina ih ngah tup halang erah ih seng Wah uh tup eha. Erah ang ah bah, ‘Seng Wah ah baat kohe’ ngeh ih tiim esuh liihan?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Philip, an ih tanih hanpiiko ngah seng Wah damdi eno seng Wah ah nga damdi ngeh ah? Ngah jenglang jengkhaap ah nga jeng tah angka.&gt;&gt; Jisu ih heliphante loong asuh baat rumta, Nga damdi waktong hala seng Wah ah ih heh mootkaat ah kala. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ngah ih baat rumhala ah hanpi an, ngah seng Wah damdi, seng Wah ah nga damdi. Ngah lahanpi riibah uh, nga reelang ah hanpi an. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ngah ih amiisak baat rumhala: O mina ih ngah hanpi halang erah ih ngah reelang nang ih elong mootkaat jen mokah ah, tiimnge liidi, ngah seng Wah taang ni wanglang. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih nga mendoh sen ih tiim suh an erah reekot ih rumha, eno Hewah rangka ah Hesah jun ih noisok ah. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nga mendoh sen ih tiimjih suh he<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mararah le ni amuh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ngah ah.</char></note> nga ih reekot ih rumha.</para>
  <para style="s">Esa Chiiala kakham tiit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Sen ih nga minchan ih heebah, nga jengdang ah kap an. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Sen loong chosokte ngah ih seng Wah jiin nawa saarookwet waktong suh wahoh sukoh rumha. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Heh langla Chiiala, Rangte amiisak tiit wuubaatte. Mongrep dowa mina ih tachoka, tiimnge liidi neng ih tup uh tatupka jat uh tajatka. Enoothong sen ih bah jat ehan, heh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">heh ;</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mararah ni </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ang ah </char></note> sen damdam waktong hala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Ngah wang ih angdoh, sen luulu tathiinhaat rumra; ngah sen jiinnah weengaak kaat ehang. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Chomroe lidoh mongrep mina ih ngah takah tuprang ang ah, enoothong sen ih bah tup ih he, tiimnge liidi ngah ething tong ang; sen uh ething tong an. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Heh rangwu thok haadoh, sen ih erah doh jat an ngah seng Wah damdi eno sen uh nga damdi, sen damdi ang halang likhiik ah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;O mina ih nga jengdang loong ah chaat ano kap ah heh juuba nga minchante ah. Seng Wah ih nga minchante loong ah minchan eha; ngah uh erah mina ah minchan ehang eno nga teewah tiit ah neng suh dongjat thuk ang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Judas (arah ah Judas Iskariot tah angka) ih liita, &lt;&lt;Teesu, mongrep mina suh an teewah ah lajat thukthang ih seng suh luulu jatthuk hali rah mamah mi ang ah?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaat rumta, &lt;&lt;O mina ih ngah minchan hang erah ih ngah ih nyootsoot hang ah kap ih ah. Seng Wah ih uh erah mih ah minchan ih ah eno sek Soowah raahe tiino neng damdoh waktong raahe tih. <verse number="24" style="v"/>O mina ih ngah taminchan rang erah mih ah ih ngah ih nyootsoot hang ah uh takapka. Eno ngah ih ngaathung ih tanyootsoot rumra, erabah nga daapkaatte seng Wah jengkhaap nyootsoot rumhala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Arah sen damdi tongpoot diiba baat rumhala. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Sen chosokte, Esa Chiiala ah seng Wah ih nga mendoh kaat thuk ha, erah ih jirep ah nyootsoot han eno ngah ih nyoot rumhala ah samthun ih thuk han.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Nga jiin dowa semroongroong ih tongjih ah sen suh thiinhaat koh rumhala. Mongrep mina ih koha likhiik takoh rumra. Sen naksootsaam an; cho uh nakcho an. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ngah ih sen suh baatrum taha ah chaat etan, ‘thiinhaat ih rumhala ngeh ah, enoothong ngah sen taang nah we ngaakkaat ehang.’ Sen ih ngah minchan ehe bah ah, seng Wah reeni wanglang asuh sen roon ih an; tiimnge liidi seng Wah ah nga nang ih elong. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Jirep ah maang angkaadi amadi banbaat rumhala, emah ang adoh, sen ih hanpi toom ih an suh ah. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Sen damdoh ngah ehan takah jen roongwaan rang, arah mongrep pante ah thok ehala. Nga khotokdi hechaan amuh, <verse number="31" style="v"/>enoothong seng Wah ah nga mongnook ngeh ih mongrep mina warep ih jat jaatjaat etheng; erah raangtaan ih heh ih tiim baat halang erah jun ih reelang.</para>
  <para style="p">&lt;&lt;Raahan, arah dowa dokkhoom eh ih.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu Juuba Anggut tiik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Ngah juuba amiisak anggut, eno seng Wah ah paachangte. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ngaaphaak ngaataang heh tiikmuh loong ah kheehaat eha, eno hetiik pan loong ah domjaan ih ah, enoobah singmoot choi nyia domjaan choi ang kano ehan ih dong tiik ah. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Sen loong abah ngah ih nyootsoot rum taha jun ih sa choi jen lang etan. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Sen loong ah nga damdoh roomtong han, ngah uh sen damdoh roomtong hang. Bangphaak ah hetiiktiik tami tiikka, heruh dowa phaakkah ah doba mi dongtiik ah. Erah likhiik sen uh nga damdoh lah angran bah sen tiik ah tami tiik kan.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Ngah juuba anggut ruh, sen loong ah hephaak. O mina nga damdoh angha nyia ngah hedamdoh angtang nooba, hetiik ah ehan ih dong tiik ah; ngah laje kangbah an ih tiim uh tami ih ko. <verse number="6" style="v"/>O ang abah uh nga damdoh lah ang raabah, erah hephaak hook toom e ah ngeh ih dook haat ah likhiik ang ah; erah likhiik abah chatjoh ano we nah ba saanjotak ah. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Sen loong ah nga damdoh tonghan bah nyia ngah ih nyootsoot rumhala jengkhaap ah kap anbah, sen ih tiimsuk suh nooklan erah choh ih an. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Seng Wah rangka ah sen tiik senlak jun ih jat ah; emah ang anno juuba sen loong ah nga liphante ang an. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Seng Wah ih ngah minchan halang ah likhiik sen uh ngah ih emah minchan rumhala; erah raangtaan ih nga minchan doh tong an. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Sen loong ih nga jengdang ah kap an nooba, nga minchan doh jen tong an, ngah ih seng Wah jengdang ah kap angno heh minchan di tonglang ah likhiik ah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;A baat rumhala ah langla, nga tonglang ah likhiik sen uh tenroon ih toomtong an ngeh ih baat rumhala, sen loong ah rapne ih eroon toom ih an. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nga jengdang ah langla arah: Ngah ih sen minchan rumhala ah likhiik sen uh emamah ih minchanmui an.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Jn 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:17">15:17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1Jn 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2Jn 5</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v"/>Elongthoon minchan ah langla maama joonte raang ih heh roidong jen koha rah. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Eno sen loong ah nga jengkhaap adoh songtong anno juuba nga joonte ih hoon an. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Sen loong asuh ngah ih nga laksuh ngeh ih takah li rumra, tiimnge liidi heh laksuh ih bah heh changte ih tiim eha erah tajatka. Erah nang ebah sen suh nga joonte li rumhala, erah thoidi seng Wah jiin nawa tiimjih chaattang loong ah thoontang baat rumhala. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ngah sen ih danje heerah tah angkang; ngah ih senba danje rumhala. Ngah ih sen tiik senlak ehanhan toom ih jaat an ngeh ih danje rumhala, hetiik saarookwet ih tong arah likhiik ah. Erah raangtaan ih nga mendoh seng Wah jiin nawa tiimjaat suh an erah ekot ehan. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih baat rumhala; sen loong ah wasiit ih wasiit minchanmui e an.</para>
  <para style="s">Mongrep mina ih chiik haat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Arah mongrep ah ih miksuk ih hanbah, sen ih samthun ih an ngah phang miksuk rum tahang ah. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Sen arah mongrep mina angtan bah neng mina likhiik ih minchan theng tahan. Enoothong ngah ih sen loong ah arah hadaang dowa danje rum taha, neng mina tah angkan. Erah thoidi miksuh halan. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ngah ih baat rum taha ah samthun an; ‘dah ah mabah uh heh changte nang ih elong tah angka.’ Neng ih ngah siiwi ih rumtahang bah sen uh siiwi ehan; ngah ih nyootsoot rumtang ah kap rumta bah sen ih nyootsoot han ah uh kap etheng rumta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Jn 13:16</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v"/>Eno sen loong nga mina angkan no siiwi ih han ang ah. Erah damdi ngah o ih daapkaat tahang warah neng ih tajat rumka. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Neng reenah ngah lakaat dobah nyia laroongwaan kaat dobah neng loong ah rangdah nah tamoong theng rumta; aadowa ebah, neng rangdah ah biin anaan takah chorumka. <verse number="23" style="v"/>O mina ih ngah miksuk halang seng Wah uh miksuk eha. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Neng loong ah rangdah tah angtheng rumta ngah ih o uh lathaak reeka ah neng dung nah lamok reetang bah ah; tiimnge liidi, neng ih nga mamah reetang loong ah tup ih rumha, eno neng ih sek Soowah wanyiinyi miksuk hali tih. <verse number="25" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Rsb 35:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:4">69:4</ref></char></note> Enoothong, erah elang jaatjaat etheng angta, neng Hootthe ni banraang thiinta ah amiisak doh ang etheng: ‘Ngah tiim lathih kangdi chiik haat rum halang.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Chosokte ah kaat eha—erah langla Chiiala, Rangte tiit ami ah wuubaat suh seng Wah reenawa raaha. Ngah ih seng Wah reenawa daapkaat hang, eno heh ih nga tiit ah baat han. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Eno, sen loong ah jaakhoh dowa ih nga damdi ang thoidoh sen ih uh nga tiit tumbaat an.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Ngah ih arah jengkhaap ah baat rumhala, sen laalom ah naktoom toihaat an ngeh ah. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Sen loong ah Jehudi rangsoomnok nawa dokphanhaat ehan, eno sen tek haat saapoot uh thok eha, neng ih mok samthun ah sen tek haat ah suh Rangte mootkaat kalang ngeh ah. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Sek Soowah ah lajat thoidoh miloong ah emah reeraang rum ah. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Amadi sen loong asuh baat rumhala langla, emah ih siiwi handoh sen loong ah ih toom samthun an.</para>
  <para style="s">Esa Chiiala Mootkaat</para>
  <para style="p">&lt;&lt;Jaakhodi, ngah sen damdi ang thoidi arah tiit ah tabaat rum taha. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ngah o ih daapkaat tahang, amadi heh taang ni ngaakwang lang, erabah uh sen ih ngasuh mani wanglu ngeh ih o ih uh tacheng ri. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Eno amadi sen suh emah baatrum kohaano, sen loong ah thungjoong elan. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Enoothong sen loong asuh amiisak tiit ah baat rumhala: Ngah wanglaan ih ang bah sen raang ih ese ang ah, tiimnge liidi ngah lamok wang kangbah sen Chosokte ah sen jiinnah taraara ang ah. Enoothong ngah dok soonwang tangno, sen Chosokte ah ekaat ih thuk hang. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Esa Chiiala ah ra haano, mongrep mina suh neng rangdah tiit ah jatthuk ah, kateng tiit ah jatthuk ah, erah damdoh Rangte ih dande tiit ah jatthuk ih ah. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ngah lahanpi thoidoh, neng ih rangdah tiit ah tadanjat rumka ang ah; <verse number="10" style="v"/>neng ih kateng tiit ah tajat rumka, tiimnge liidi ngah seng Wah reeni wanglang eno ngah takah japtupri ang ah, <verse number="11" style="v"/>eno neng loong ah dande tiit ah tajat rumka, tiimnge liidi arah mongrep dowa neng pante ah jen dande eta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Ngah ih sen suh baattheng ene tah angka, erabah uh amadoh baat rumha bah tajen naanchaat kan ang ah. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Enoothong, Rangte amiitiit jatthukte Chiiala raaha doh, heh ih amiisak lampo adoh siit han. Heh ih heh chaan nawa ih tajengka ang ah, enoothong heh ih tiimjih japchaat ah erah ba jeng ah nyia lakngah nawa tiit ah ba baat han. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Sen suh Chiiala ah ih nga jeng ah baatkaat hanno nga rangka thuk hang. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Seng Wah suh tiimjeela jirep ah nga raangtaan; erah thoidoi baat rumhala Chiiala ih nga jiin nawa tiim chaat ah erah ah baat han.</para>
  <para style="s">Thungjoong nyi tenroon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Chomroe doh sen ih ngah takah boot japtupri, eno chomroe lidoh ngah we japtup ehe.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mararah heliphante loong ah nengneng chengmui rumta, &lt;&lt;Heh ih tiim asuh liiha, chomroe doh sen ih takah boot japtupri eno chomroe lidoh ngah we japtup ehe ngeh ah; eno heh ih emah uh eli eha, ‘tiimnge liidi ngah seng Wah jiinni wanglang.’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Chomroe ah tiim asuh liiha? Tiimjih suh li koja, erah seng ih tajatke!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Jisu ih jat eta, heliphante loong ih heh suh cheng ah ngeh ah, erah raangtaan ih Jisu ih baat rumta, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih liihang, ‘Chomroe sen ih takah boot japtupri, eno chomroe lidoh pootsiit we tup ehe.’ Erah li kangno tanih kah chengmui lan? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ngah ih ami tiit ah baat rumhala: Seng loong ah nga raangtaan ih ehu ih an, enoothong mongrep dowa miloong ah eroon ih ah; sen loong abah thungthet ih an erabah uh erah lih adoh eroon ih an. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Minuh ah heh sah tup tok thok kohaano sootsaam ela, tiimnge liidi heh chamnaang tok ah thok ehala; enoothong heh sah dongtup ano heh chamchoh ah beehaat eha, tiimnge liidi heh arah mongrep adi heh sah tup kano eroon ela. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Erah likhiik sen loong asuh emamah ang ah: Amadi sen loong ah thungthet elan, enoothong ngah ih we japtup ih rumha, eno sen loong ah erah than ih roon an sen tenroon ah o ih uh tajen nge ran.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Sen loong asuh ami tiit ah baat rumhala, saapoot thok haadoh sen ih tiim uh tasuh ri ang ah. Sen suh amiisak tiit baat rumhala; nga mendoh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nga mendoh seng Wah jiin nawa tiim suh an, heh ih kot ih han; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mararah ni </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Seng Wah jiin nawa tiim suh an nga mendoh kot ehan ang ah</char></note> seng Wah jiin nawa tiimsuh an, erah heh ih kot ih han. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Amadoh nga mendoh maang suh ang an bah; sen ih suk ih an, eno erah choh anno sen ten laanchem roh ih roon an.</para>
  <para style="s">Mongrep jen ah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Ngah ih arah jengkhaap loong ah tiitthaak toobaat damdi baat rumhala. Enoothong saapoot ah thok eha ngah ih tiitthaak lam ih takah baat rumra, enoothong seng Wah tiit ah saasa ih baat rumha. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Erah rangwu thok haadoh sen loong ah ih seng Wah jiin nawa nga mendoh suh an, sen mendoh nga ih suh ang ngeh ih taliikang, <verse number="27" style="v"/>Sengwah heteteewah ih sen loong ah minchan ih halan. Sen loong ah ih ngah nook kohe nyia Rangte reenawa ra hala ngeh ih hanpi thoidi seng Wah ih sen uh minchan ih halan. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ngah arah mongrep adi seng Wah reenawa ra tahang, eno arah mongrep ah thiinhaat angno seng Wah jiinni ngaakwang lang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Eno heliphante loong ah ih Jisu suh baatta, &lt;&lt;Amadi bah an ih saasa ih jenglu, tiitthaak lam ih labaat ah. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Amadi kokjat ehi an ih jirep ah jat ehu ngeh ah; an suh mih ih miicheng jih tajeeka. Erah thoidi Rangte reenawa raahalu ngeh ih seng ih jat ehi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakcheng rumta, &lt;&lt;Amadi hanpi tam ih han? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Saapoot ah amadi jen thok ehala, sen loong ah noongrep nah saapsoon an, nga luulu thiinhaat heeno sen nok nah saapsoon an. Enoothong emah ebah nga luulu tah angkang, tiimnge liidi seng Wah nga damdi eje. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ngah ih arah tiit ah nga damdi anghanno semroongroong ih toomtong rum ah ngeh ih baat rumhala. Sen loong ah mongrep mih ih chamnaang ih thuk han. Enoothong sen lacho theng! Ngah ih mongrep ah jen etang!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Heliphante loong suh Jisu ih rangsoom kota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Erah jeng ano Jisu rangko toonsokwan ano liita, &lt;&lt;Ewah, saapoot ah thok ehala, an Sah rangka thuk uh, heh ih an toom we choomjoot thuk ho. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mina thoontang khothung ni an ih heh suh chaan aphaan kotu, an ih kotu mina loong asuh lathoon theng roidong jen kot suh ah. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lathoon theng roidong ah langla, amiisak Rangte ah an luulu jat halu nyia an ih daapkaat taho Kristo jat ha asuh liiha. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Arah hah adi an rangka ah ngah ih noisok etang; an ih mootthuk tahang mootkaat ah ejen etang. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ewah! Arah hah maangdong di, an damdi angtok doh nga rangka tahang ah likhiik an ngathong nah amadoh nga rangka hang.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Arah mongrep dowa mina kotahang loong asuh an ejat ih thuk taha. Erah koh halang mina loong ah an mina angta. Neng ih an jeng ah kap eta, <verse number="7" style="v"/>eno an ih koh halang jirep ah an jiin nawa ra hala ngeh ih amadi jat ih rumha. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Neng suh an tiitkhaap baat tahang tiit ah baat ih rumtang, eno neng ih erah tiitkhaap ah kap ih rumta; neng ih jat eha ngah amiisak an reenawa ra tahang, eno an ih daapkaat tahang ah neng ih hanpi ih rumha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Ngah ih neng raang ih soomhang. Arah mongrep raangtaan ih tah soomkang, enoothong an ih kotahang loong raang ih soomhang, tiimnge liidi neng loong an mina. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nga dam dowa loong ah an mina, an reedowa mina loong ah nga raangtaan; nga rangka ah neng jun ih noisok ha. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Eno, ngah amadi an taang ni wang halang; arah mongrep adi takah boottong kang, enoothong neng loong ah arah mongrep adi thiinhaat hang. Esa Rangte! An ih ngasuh kotahang men<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">An ih kotahang men, chaan aphaan mendoh, puipang rum uh; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mararah le ni liiha </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Anchaan anphaan mendoh ngasuh kotahang loong ah puipang rum uh </char></note> dowa chaan anphaan nawa ih puipang ih rum uh, sek esiit angli tih likhiik neng uh esiit toom angrum ah. <verse number="12" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Rsb 41:9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:18">Jn 13:18</ref></char></note> Ngah neng loong damdi angtang adoh an ih kotahang men<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">An ih kotahang, chaan aphaan mendoh, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mararah le ni liiha </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Anchaan anphaan mendi nga suh kotang mendi puipang rum hang</char></note> dowa chaan aphaan nawa ih puipang ih rumtang, wasiit taan uh maat haat muh, marah emat jaatjaat ete angta ba mata—erabah Rangteele ni raangha jun ih ang etheng jaatjaat angta. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Amadi ngah an reeni wang halang, eno ngah arah mongrep ni angang di nga tenroon nah neng ten laanchem roh toomtong rum ah ngeh liihang. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ngah ih an tiitkhaap ah baatrum kangno arah mongrep dowa miloong ah ih miksuk ih rumha, neng uh nga likhiikkhiik arah mongrep mih takah angrumka. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ngah ih neng loong ah arah mongrep dowa toonsiit ih uh ngeh taliikang, neng loong ah Soitaan lak nawa puipang esuh baat we hala. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nga likhiikkhiik neng uh arah mongrep mih takah angka. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Amiitiit jun ih neng loong ah anteewah lak nah look haat uh, tiimnge liidi an jengkhaap ah amiisak. <verse number="18" style="v"/>An ih ngah mamah ih daapkaat tahang, erah likhiik ngah ih uh neng loong ah mongrep ni daapkaat rumlang. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Neng raang ih nga teewah an suh look haat hala, tiimnge liidi neng ih uh neng teewah ah amiisak ih an lak nah toom look haat rumho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Neng raang ih luulu tasoomkang, neng ih tiitkhaap baatkaat rum adoh nga hanpiite loong raang ih nep soomhang. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Neng loongtang esiit ih toom angrum ah. Ewah! Neng loong ah sek damdoh toom jen angha, an nga damdi adoleh ngah an damdi likhiik ah. Neng loong ah esiit toom angrum ah, arah mongrep dowa miloong ah ih ngah an ih daapkaat tahang ah toom hanpi rum ah. <verse number="22" style="v"/>An ih choomjoh tahang ah likhiik ih neng uh emamah ih rangka thuk rumhang, enooba neng esiit ih angrum ah, seknyi angli tih likhiik ah: <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ngah neng damdi eno an nga damdi, enooba neng loong ah esiit jaatjaat ih angrum ah, tiimnge liidi arah mongrep dowa miloong ah ih ngah an ih daapkaat tahang ah toomjat rum ah nyia an ih ngah minchan halang ah likhiik neng uh an ih emamah ih minchan hu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Ewah! Neng loong ah an ih ngasuh kohalang, eno ngah manah angang neng uh nga damdam toom ang rumha, enooba neng ih nga rangka ah chotup rum ah, marah mongrep maanghoon di nga rangka tu nyia minchan ih tahang ah. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ewah Katengthoon! Arah hah dowa miloong ah ih tajat ru ngah ih ba jat hala eno arah loong ah ih an ih daapkaat tahang ngeh ih jat rumha. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Neng suh an jen jat ih thukrum taha, eno erah jatroh ih thukrum ang, enooba an ih nga minchan halang ah neng ih uh choh toom ih rum ah, eno ngah uh neng damdoh eje toom ang ang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu jokhakta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Jisu ih rang ah jensoom ano, Kidron joisah saangko heliphante loong damdi daankata. Erah di pa esiit angta, eno Jisu nyia heliphante loong ah erah di nopwang rumta. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Jisu jootkotte Judas ih erah pa ah mani angta erah jat eta, tiimnge liidi heliphante loong ah damdi Jisu erah di hepoot hepoot pakchomui roh ka ih rumta. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Erah thoidi romwah phokhothoon nyia Pharisi nok hah loong ah ih Judas damdi Room nok hah sipaahi nyia Rangteenook bante loong ah langpi papi ih wangthuk rumta, eno neng loong ah weetook nyia phiitwe ah piirum ano erah pa adi nopwang rumta. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Jisu ih heh teeteewah ah mamah theng ah, erah banjat eta, eno neng taangko ih tiitkhoom kah ano cheng rumta, &lt;&lt;O jam han sen ih ah?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Najaret dowa Jisu,” neng loong ah ih ngaakbaat rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">“Erah liihan abah ngah,” Jisu ih baat rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">Mih khumtante, Judaas, ah erah di roongchap wangta. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Jisu ih &lt;&lt;Erah liihan abah ngah ngeh ih liikano&lt;&lt; neng liko ih ngaakchap rum ano hah ni loongjup rumta. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Jisu ih weengaak cheng rumta, “O jam han sen ih ah?”</para>
  <para style="p">“ Najaret dowa Jisu,” neng loong ah ih liita.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Ngah ih jen baat ih rum taha erabah ngah ngeh ah.&gt;&gt; Jisu ih baat rumta, &lt;&lt;Ngah jam hali bah wahoh loong ah ngaakkaat ih thuk an.’’ Jisu ih emah ih li rumta. (<verse number="9" style="v"/>Heh ih maangdi ban baatta ah amiisak ih angsuh neng loong asuh emah li rumta, Jisu ih Hewah rang ah emah ih soomta: &lt;&lt;Ewah! An ih kotahang miloong ah wasiit taan uh ngah ih mat haatmuh.&gt;&gt;)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Simon Pitar ih lang esiit huita, erah dokkhoom ano Romwah phokhothoon dah na ah dakmiiko ah dat dookta. Erah dah men ah langla Malkus ngeh angta. <verse number="11" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Mat 26:39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mk 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:42">Luk 22:42</ref></char></note> Jisu ih Pitar suh liita, &lt;&lt;An lang ah hetoop adoh sak hui uh! Seng Wah ih kohalang chamnaang lookkep<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lookkep: Aradi lookkep ah chamchoh theng ang kano liiha, Jisu ih chamnaang lookkep ni jok ah likhiik cham ah</char></note> adoh tajokka nih thun hu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Annas reeni Jisu siitwanta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Eno Room nawa sipaahi nyia neng saahaap, erah damdi Jehudi nok hah bante loong ah ih Jisu ah jorum ano kit rumta, <verse number="13" style="v"/>jaakhoh thoon ah Kaiphas hopwah Anna reeni siitwan rumta, erah paang adi Kaiphas ah Romwah Phokhothoon angta. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Jehudi ngoong awang loong asuh loongtang raang ih wasiit tek ah eseethoon ang ah ngeh ih hukbaatte ah Kaiphas angta.</para>
  <para style="s">Pitar ih Jisu leekbaatta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69">Mat 26:69</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:70">70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mk 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pitar nyia heliphante wahoh wasiit Jisu lilih ih phankhoom kanyuuta. Erah heliphante ah Romwah Phokhothoon damdi menjat ang thoidi, Romwah Phokhothoon nok taakkhu ni Jisu damdi waknop wangta, <verse number="16" style="v"/>eno Pitar ah paakaawan adi banchapta. Heliphante ah kaalu ko ngaak kah ano jaalasah nusiit chapta asuh baat ano Pitar ah waknopsiit wanta. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Enoothong jaalasah rah ih kaalu adi Pitar suh chengta, &lt;&lt;An uh Jisu liphante tanih angkoko?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">&lt;&lt;Ngah tah angkang,&gt;&gt; Pitar ih ngaakbaatta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Song ang kano, laksuh nyia bante loong ah we ah takrum ano songlom suh weekaang ni kookchap rumta. Erah di Pitar ah wang ano weekaang ni roong lomchap wangta.</para>
  <para style="s">Romwah Phokhoh ih Jisu suh chengta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mk 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Romwah Phokhothoon ih Jisu suh heliphante loong tiit nyia heh ih nyootsootta ah chengta. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaatta, “Saarookwet ngah nokraat ni mirep suh saasa ih jenglang; Jehudi rangsoomnok ni nyia Rangteenok ni, maradi miloong ah kalomkhoon rum taha di ah. Mabah uh ngah husah ni jengmuh <verse number="21" style="v"/>An ih emah tiim esuh cheng halang? Nga jeng boichaatte loong asuh cheng uh. Ngah ih tiimjih baat rumtang neng ih chaat eta.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Jisu ih emah li kano, bante dowa wasiit ih hethe ni baangbuh ano liita, &lt;&lt;Romwah Phokhothoon suh an ih emah mamah naan liihu!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Jisu ih heh suh ngaak liitta, “Ngah tiim bah uh mokjeng etang bah, mirep suh adoh baat uh. Enoothong ngah tiim jengtang erah punjeng etang baleh tiim esuh buh halang?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Annas ih Jisu ah kitchoi Romwah Phokhothoon Kaiphas taang ni wangthukta.</para>
  <para style="s">Pitar ih Jisu we leekbaatta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mk 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Erah di Pitar ah weekaang ni chaproh eta. Erah thoidi miloong ah ih cheng rumta, &lt;&lt;An uh erah wah liphante taba ang koko?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Pitar ih weeliita, &lt;&lt;Ngah ah tah angkang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Romwah Phokhothoon dah wasiit, Pitar ih heh na datdook ta phoh awah erah di eje angta. Erah dah rah ih liita, &lt;&lt;Jisu damdi pa ni taba tup taha?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Eno Pitar we leekta, Tajatkang—erah damdam ih woh ah weeta.</para>
  <para style="s">Pilat reeni Jisu siitwan rumta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mat 27:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mk 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Rangkhano ih Kaiphas nok nawa Jisu ah Kobono noklong<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">noklong: Kobono nok asuh liiha</char></note> ni siitwan rumta. Neng banlam di Khopi kuwaang miiphaksat suh neng ah esa ang theng, erah thoidi Jehudi ngoong awang loong ah kobono nokmong ni tanop wang rumta. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Erah thoidi Pilat ah dokkhoom kah ano chengkah rumta, &lt;&lt;Arah mih ah tiim thoidi jowan halan?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Neng ih ngaakbaatta, &lt;&lt;Lamoongre dobah an suh ju tajoot kot wantheng tahe.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>&lt;&lt;Emah ang abah sen hootthe jun ih mat ah taat hoonkaat thaak an.&gt;&gt; Pilat ih baat rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">Jehudi loong ah ih ngaakli rumta, &lt;&lt;Seng ih mih tami tek haatke.&gt;&gt; (<verse number="32" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">Jn 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:32">12:32</ref></char></note> Erah langla Jisu ih heh mamah ih tektheng ah erah tiit ban baatta ah wuusa nah amiimi dong angsuh jeng rumta.)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pilat ih Jisu nokmong ni poonwan ano cheng wanta, &lt;&lt;An Jehudi Luuwang nih ah?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaatta, &lt;&lt;Nga tiit ah an thung ih tamcheng halang tam aleh mih ih baat ho ih cheng halang?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Pilat ih ngaak liita, &lt;&lt;Ngah suh Jehudi nok hah nih li halang? An mina loong nyia romwah phokhoh loong ih ba jokoh wanrum halang. An tiimjih ih kotu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaakbaatta, &lt;&lt;Nga hasong ah arah mongrep hasong tah angka; arah mongrep hasong angta bah nga lih phanjootte loong ah Jehudi ngoong awang suh lajoot thuksuh mui etheng rumta. Nga hasong bah mongrep hasong tah angka.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Eno Pilat ih Jisu suh chengta, &lt;&lt;Enoobah, an luuwang tam ah?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Jisu ih ngaakbaatta, &lt;&lt;An ih liitu ngah luuwang ngeh ah. Ngabah dongtup hangno arah mongrep adi jisiit raangtaan ih ra tahang, erah langla amiitiit ah baat suh. O mina amiisak mih ang ah erah ih nga jeng ah boichaat hang .</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>“Enoobah amiitiit ah tiimah?” Pilat ih chengta.</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu tek haat thukta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mat 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mk 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">Eno Pilat ah weengaak dokkhoom kah ano miloong asuh liikah rumta, &lt;&lt;Heh tiim thoilam doh thet haat theng ah ngah ebah tah jatjoh kang. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Enoothong sen banlam di, Khopiikuh rookwet sen raangtaan ih phaatak nawa wasiit ah daap haat koroh erum hala. Sen loong raangtaan ih Jehudi luuwang ah daap haat kot ah tamjam han?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Neng loong ah ih riiraak damdi ngaakbaat rumta, “Heh tah angka! Barabbas jamhi! (Barabbas ah miputte angta.)</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Eno Pilat ih Jisu ah siitwan ano ruh ih bot thuk rumta. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Arami loong ah ih bangkaang hesupan nawa ih khopok ah hoon rum ano hekhoh ni pokthuk rumta; saangham nyuh ah hesak adi dekkoh rum eta <verse number="3" style="v"/>heh reeni raarum hano li rumta, “Roiloh toom angkah Jehudi luwang ah!” Eno neng ah wangrum ano paatbuh rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pilat ah jaasiit we ngaak dokkhoom kah ano miloong asuh baat rumta, “sok thaak an, nga ih sen reenah dongsiit kaat hang, enoothong heh tek haatjih bah ngah ih tachoh jokang.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Erah di Jisu ah dokkhoom ra taha, sukhopok ah pok saangham nyuh ah kap ano dong ra taha. Pilat ih baat rumta, sok thaak an, mih abah arah!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Heh ah kaptup rum ano romwah phokhoh loong nyia Rangteenok bante loong ah ri rumta, “Heh ah tekrapbot etheng! Heh ah tekrapbot etheng!”</para>
  <para style="p">Pilat ih li rumta, “Siitkaat anno tekrapbot kaat an. Ngah ebah heh dut haat<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dut haat: Lakah ngaak kapka asuh dut haat liiha</char></note> theng tajapjoh kang.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Miloong ah ih ngaak riibaat rumta, seng hotthe ni eli eha heh ah tek haat etheng ngeh ah, tiimnge liidi heh ih ngah Rangte Sah ngeh chaangta.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Erah chaat ano Pilat ah ehan han ih choota. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pilat ah nopwang ano Jisu suh cheng wangta, &lt;&lt;An manawa ra halu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Enoothong Jisu tangaak jengta. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pilat ih liita, &lt;&lt;Nga damdoh tanih waan ru?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;An ih tanih jatko nga jiinni chaan jeela ngeh ah, daap uh jen daap haat eha bangphak nah uh jen rapbot eha.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Jisu ih ngaak liita, An ih ngah tiim ehang bah uh erah chaan ah Rangte ih koh halu. Erah raangtaan ih an suh nga jootkotte ah rapne ih moong reela.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Jisu jeng ah chaat ano, Pilat ih daap haat taat chungta. Enoothong miloong ah weengaak ri rumta, &lt;&lt;An ih Jisu mok daap haat ubah, Luuwanglong joonte tah angko! O mina ih ngah Luuwang ngeh ih chaangha mih abah Luuwanglong piiara!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pilat ih erah jeng ah chaat ano, mat hoonkotte “Jongtongtheng” ngeh ih menrumta adi Jisu ah doksiit kaat ano tong kata (erah suh Hebrew nok hah ih &lt;&lt;Gabbatha&lt;&lt; ngeh menta.) <verse number="14" style="v"/>Khopui Kuwaang phaksat khookhamja rangnithung di Pilat ih miloong asuh liita, &lt;&lt;Sen Luuwang ah arah!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Eno miloong ah ngaak ri rumta, &lt;&lt;Tek haat etheng! Tek haat etheng! Bangphak khona rapbot theng!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Pilat ih cheng rumta, &lt;&lt;Sen Luuwang ah nih tek haatthuk he?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Romwah phokhoh loong ih ngaakbaatta, &lt;&lt;Seng luuwang bah Luuwanglong luulu!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Eno Pilat ih Jehudi loong asuh Jisu ah bangphak khoni rapbotkaat thuk rumta.</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu rapbot rumta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">Miloong ah ih Jisu doksiit kaat rumta. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Jisu ih bangphak ah pi ano &lt;&lt;Mikhoraang hah&lt;&lt; adi kata. (Jehudi loong ih &lt;&lt;Golgotha&lt;&lt; ngeh menha.) <verse number="18" style="v"/>Jisu damdi mih wanyi ah uh erah di rapbot rumta, Jisu ah ehong adi mih wanyi ah haanghop ih rapbot rumta. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pilat ih mih suh jatthuk suh raang ano bangphak adi chiita, erah di raangta, &lt;&lt;Najaret dowa Jisu, Jehudi Luuwang.&gt;&gt; <verse number="20" style="v"/>Erah le adi Hebrew, Latin nyia Grik jenglam ih raangta, eno samnuthung dowa ih Jisu rapbotta hah ah haloh lah angkokaano mirep ih erah raangta ah toonsokleh weh kah ih rumta. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Romwah phokhoh loong ah Pilat reeni wang ano liita, &lt;&lt;Jehudi Luuwang&lt;&lt; ngeh ih nak raang uh&lt;&lt; erah nang ih bah &lt;&lt;Arah mih ah ih liita, Ngah Jehudi Luuwang&lt;&lt; emah ih raang uh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pilat ih ngaak liita, &lt;&lt;Ngah ih tiimjih raangtang, emamah toom ang ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Sipaahi loong ah ih Jisu ah bangphak ni rapbot lini heh ih kapta nyuh ah khoobaji ih khoohoom rum ano phe rumta. Heh samsong ah uh wakpi ih rumta, erah samsong ah hewet muh khoolaan angta. <verse number="24" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Rsb 22:18</ref></char></note> Sipaahi loong ah nengneng jaachi ni baatmui rumta, &lt;&lt;Seng ih lakhoohoom theng; eranang ebah o ih choh thaak asuh jong tetaak ah rang nah haat eno tootoon ih.&gt;&gt; Arah langla Rangteele ni amah raangthiinta ah amiisak ih dong angta:</para>
  <para style="p">&lt;&lt;Neng loong ah ih nga nyuh ah phe ih rumta</para>
  <para style="q1">eno nga samsong ah rang ni</para>
  <para style="q2">haat rum ano tootoon rumta.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m">Sipaahi loong ah emamah ih reeraang rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Jisu bangphak re adi heh nuh nyia heh no Klopas minuh Meeri chapta, Meeri Magdalen uh erah di roongchapta. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Heh nuh nyia heliphante hemongnook warah japtup ano Jisu ih heh nuh suh liita, &lt;&lt;Heh an sah.&gt;&gt; <verse number="27" style="v"/>Erah lih adi heliphante asuh liita, &lt;&lt;Arah an nuh.&gt;&gt; Erah ja dowa ih heliphante ah ih erah nuh ah heh nok ni siitkaatta.</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu tiita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:21">Rsb 69:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:15">22:15</ref></char>
    </note>Jisu ih jat eta jirep ah thoon eta; eno Rangteele ni raangthiinta amiisak ih angsuh heh ih liita, &lt;&lt;Ngah joongle ih leelang.&gt;&gt; <verse number="29" style="v"/>Erah di thaangneethoon kham keethiin choi khaplang esiit angta, mih wasiit ih kham adi nyuchiin ah tem ano, hissop bangkaang adi khakta, eno toonpi ano Jisu tui ni mooksuta. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Jisu ih erah jok ano jengta, &lt;&lt;Thoon eta!&gt;&gt; Eno heh tok ah songhaat ano thaktiita.</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu saam ni loosuh rumta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Eno Jehudi ngoong awang loong ah ih Pilat suh bangphak khoni rapbot rumta loong lah ah thabuh rum ano datthiin esuh cheng rumta. Erah saalih adi Jehudi naangtongsa, hoondak rangwuuja angta, erah thoidi neng ih thunta Jehudi naangtongsa doh neng mang ah bangphak khonah naktoom thoktong ah ngeh ah. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Eno sipaahi loong ah ih jaakhoh ah Jisu reeni rapbotta mih lah thabuh ano wasiit lah ah we thabuh rumta. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Enoothong Jisu reeni wang rum adi jen tekchoi ang kano, heh lah ah tathabuh rumta. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Enoothong, sipaahi wasiit ih heh saam ni Pah ih sot kano joong nyi sih loong ah dokjanta. (<verse number="35" style="v"/>Erah angta rah mih ih heh mikmik ih japtup arah baat ha, erah raangtaan ih sen ih uh hanpi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">hanpi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mararah le ni</char><char style="fq" closed="false">hanpi roh ih an liiha. </char></note> ih an. Erah baatte ah ih amiitiit ah jat eha, ngah ih amiitiit ah baat hang ngeh ah.) <verse number="36" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Hpkt 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Erok 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Rsb 34:20</ref> </char></note> Rangteele ni raangthiinta ah amiisak ih angla: Erah di amah raangha, &lt;&lt;heraang esiit taan uh tathaka.&gt;&gt; <verse number="37" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Jek 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Mot 1:7</ref> </char></note> Rangteele ehoh ni uh li eha &lt;&lt;Pah esuh arah miloong ah ih kooksok ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu bengkaat tiit</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Erah lih adi, Aramia nok hah Josep ih Pilat suh Jisu mang ah jenpi nih ih kaat ang ngeh cheng wangta. (Josep ah husah di Jisu liphante angta, enoothong heh Jehudi ngoong awang ra choota.) Pilat ih jenpi ih kaat uh li kano Josep ih bangphak dowa heh mang ah datpi wangta. <verse number="39" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1-2">Jn 3:1-2</ref></char></note> Heh damdi Nikodimas roongwaangta, jaakhoh ni uh Jisu damdi heh rangphe di chomui choi angta. Nikodimas ih phontum jih miir nyia aloes ah woi ano took rookjom taan piikaatta. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Erah nyi ih Jisu mang ah datpi nyuh ano phontum ah ih hut nyuuta, eno nyuh ih thooploop nyu ano Jehudi banlam di ebeng ih kaat suh emah ih khookham rumta. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Jisu tek haat rumta pa adi mangbeng theng ena esiit angta erah di o mang uh beng muh angta. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Jehudi naangtongsa ah erah saalih adi angta eno erah mangbeng ah uh haniik ni ang thoidi Jisu mang ah erah di beng nyuuta.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mang beng ehu tiit</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mk 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Naangtongsa, Meeri Megdalen chichuuwi ih rang maang phaakwu kaadi mangbeng ah taatsok kah adi mangbeng kepta jong dokkongchoi angta. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Erah thoidi, Pitar nyia Jisu mongnook heliphante reeni soonkah ano baatkaat nyuuta, &lt;&lt;Teesu bah mangbeng nawa mih ih dokpi ih katta, mani thiinkaat koja tajatke!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Erah baatrum kano, heliphante hejoon wasiit siit ano Pitar nengnyi ih mangbeng ah sokkah nyuuta. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nengnyi echaan ih taatsoon kanyuuta, erabah uh heliphante wasiit ah Pitar ah jiitsoon ano jaakhoh thok soonta. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mang beng adi ngupbon ano taatsok adi hemong ni nyuh waariiri jangdat arah japtupta, enoothong hemong ni heh nopwang muh. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Heh lilih Simon Pitar ah thok haano, phangla ih nopwangta. Heh uh erah di nyuleep jangdat arah nyia <verse number="7" style="v"/>heh khoh dekta nyuh ah japtup wangta. Heh khodek nyuh ah hetuituidat eta nyuh ah damdi lah angthang ah. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Eno heliphante wasiit jaakhoh thokte warah uh roong nop ih wangta eno nyuh ah japtup ano heh ih hanpi eta. (<verse number="9" style="v"/>Erah pootdi neng ih Rangteele ni raangthiinta ah tajat rumta, tek nawa we ngaaksaat jaatjaat ih ah liiha rah ah.) <verse number="10" style="v"/>Eno heliphante wanyi ah nok ni ngaakwang nyuuta.</para>
  <para style="s">Meeri Megdaleen reeni Jisu dongta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9">Mat 28:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mk 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Meeri ah mangbeng kaang ni chap ano huuta. Hu damdi, mangbeng adi ngupbon sok adi <verse number="12" style="v"/>rangsah wanyi Jisu mang thiinta adi hekhoh helah ih nyupu ah kap nyu ano tongnyu arah japtupta. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nengnyi ih cheng nyuuta, &lt;&lt;Minuh, tiimnge hu lu? Meeri ih baat nyuuta, &lt;&lt;Nga Teesu ah soonpi ih rumha, mani thiinkaat rum koja tajatkang!&gt;&gt; <verse number="14" style="v"/>Eno Meeri ah ngaakwang esuh lekchap adi Jisu japtupta; enoothong heh ih Jisu ngeh tajatta. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Jisu ih chengta, &lt;&lt;Minuh, tiimnge hu lu? O jamboi hu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Meeri ih pa ni motte heh angka ngeh samthun ano liita; Chuupha, &lt;&lt;An ih ma dokpi weeju oh? Enoobah heh mang ah mani thiinhu baat ih weehang, ngah ih toonpi kaat suh ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Jisu ih liita, &lt;&lt;Meeri!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Meeri ah Jisu taangko lekchap ano Jehudi jenglam ih liita, &lt;&lt;Rabboni!&gt;&gt; (Erah langla Jehudi jenglam ih &lt;&lt;Leenyootte&lt;&lt; suh liiha)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Jisu ih liita, &lt;&lt;Ngah nak taajoh hang&lt;&lt; Ngah seng Wah jiinni maang ngaakwang kang. Ngaaphoh ngaano loong suh baatkaat uh, seng Wah nyia neng loong Wah, nga Rangte nyia neng loong Rangte jiinni ngaakwangla ngeh ah.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih Meeri ah heliphante loong reeni kah ano Teesu japtup tiit nyia neng loong suh baatkaat tiit baatta ah baatkaat rumta.</para>
  <para style="s">Heliphante loong reeni Jisu dongta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-18">Mk 1:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Heliphante loong ah Jehudi ngoong awang loong raacho ih kaalu ah tangsak rum ano Naangtongsa rangja di nokmong ni khoontong rumta. Erah di Jisu ah neng laktung ni dongchap hano jengta, &lt;&lt;Semroongroong ih tong an.&gt;&gt; <verse number="20" style="v"/>Erah jeng ano heh lakma nyi heh saam ah noisok rumta. Eno heliphante loong ah neng Teesu ah tup rum ano rapne ih roon rumta. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Eno Jisu ih we liita, &lt;&lt;Semroongroong ih tong an.&gt;&gt; Seng Wah ih ngah kaat thuk halang ah likhiik, sen uh emamah ih kaat thukrum hala.&gt;&gt; <verse number="22" style="v"/>Erah baatrum ano neng khoni heh tak ih mot rum ano li rumta, &lt;&lt; Esa Chiiala ah thaang an.&gt;&gt; <verse number="23" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Mat 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:18">18:18</ref></char></note> Sen ih wahoh rangdah ah biin anaan hoon anbah, neng rangdah ah biin anaan hoon ih ah; sen ih biin anaan lahoon kanbah, neng rangdah ah uh biin anaan tahoonka.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu nyia Thomas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Asih wanyi heliphante loong dowa, Thomas (Twin ngeh poon rumta) ah Jisu dongkhoomta adi amuh angta. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Erah thoidi heliphante wahoh loong ah ih Thomas suh baat rumta, &lt;&lt;Seng ih Jisu japtup eti!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Eno Thomas ih li rumta, &lt;&lt;heh lak ni jaanwot ih po botta ah latup kangbah nyia heh lakpo adoleh heh saampo adoh nga laktiik maang thaak laanglaang tahanpi kang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Saasinet lidi heliphante loong ah nokmong ni we khoontong rumta doh, Thomas uh neng damdi eje angta. Nok kaalu ah tangsak choi ang adi Jisu neng laktung ni we dongchap wang ano jengta, &lt;&lt;Semroongroong ih tong an.&gt;&gt; <verse number="27" style="v"/>Eno Jisu ih Thomas suh liita, &lt;&lt;An laktiik ih tasuh uno nga lakma ah Taat sok thaak uh adoleh nga saam ma ah an lak ih taajoh thaak uh. Tenchi nak ang uh hanpi ih hang!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Thomas ngaakjengta, &lt;&lt;Nga Teesu nyia nga Rangte!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Jisu ih Thomas suh liita, &lt;&lt;Ngah ah tup hangno tam hanpi halang? Ngah latup rangdi hanpiiha loong ah tiimthan tenroon ah!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Arah leedap ah tiim raangtaan ah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Heliphante loong miksok di Jisu mih paatjaajih rapne ih mokata, erah loong ah arah Leedap ni raangthiin muh. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Arah sen ih hanpi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hanpi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mararah le ni liiha</char><char style="fq" closed="false">hanpi roh ih an </char></note> toom ih an ngeh ih raangthiin ha, Jisu ah Rangte Sah Kristo eno heh hanpi jun ih sen ih roidong ah choh an.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Heliphante wasinat reeni Jisu dongta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Erah lini, Taiberia juusitum adi heliphante loong ah damdi Jisu emah we dongkhoomta. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Erah di Simon Pitar, Thomas (Khaangpeh ngeh ih poon rumta ah), Nathanel (Galili kooni Kana dowa), Jebedi sah nyia Jisu liphante wanyi loongtang eroom ang rumta. <verse number="3" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:5">Luk 5:5</ref></char></note>Eno Simon Pitar ih heh joonte loong asuh baat rumta, &lt;&lt;Ngah bah chaak ha kah ang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Eno heh joon loong ah ih li rumta, “Seng uh wakkaat ehe,” eno neng loong khoonkhu ni karumta. Erah rangpheeja pheetang ih chaak ah taat ha rum adi tiim uh takap rumta. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Rangsa dong damdam di, Jisu juukaang ni banchapta, eno heliphante loong ah ih Jisu ngeh ih tajat rumta. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Eno Jisu ih cheng rumta, &lt;&lt;Jaaro loong, tiim uh tanih kap kan?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">&lt;&lt;Tiim uh takapke,” Jaaro loong ih baat rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:6">Luk 5:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Eno Jisu ih baat rumta, khoonkhu chap thuk lan dakmiiko adoh chaak ah haat an, nyah erah doh kap ih an.&gt;&gt; Erah raangtaan ih neng chaak ah haat rum ano tajen ngaak hom rumta, chaak adi nyah hantek nyaanta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Eno heliphante Jisu moongnook warah ih Pitar suh liita, &lt;&lt;Teesu bo ah!&gt;&gt; Pitar ih Teesu ngeh ih japchaat ano heh nyuh ah toonkap ano (heh nyuh ah khookpi eta) juukhoh ni datpit kata. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Heliphante wahoh loong ah chaak adi nyah hesiit ih hoom rum ano juukaang ko ih wang rumta. Saanghook dowa ih ju ah haloh tah angta, ngookchaajom taan haloot angta. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Neng loong ah juukaang adi thok rum adi, we khoni nyah nyia baanlo tupwang rumta. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Eno Jisu ih li rumta, &lt;&lt;Sen ih kaptan nyah dowa esiitnyi than piiwan han.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Simon Pitar ah khoonkhu ko ngaak kah ano chaak adi nyah elonglongwah juukaang ko ih toonhoom kata, erah di elonglong ah chaasiit rookbanga ejom angta; nyah hantek ang ah bah uh chaak ah tah randatta. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Jisu ih poon rumta, &lt;&lt;Phaksah wanghan.&gt;&gt; Eno heliphante loong ah ih o ih uh tanaan cheng rumta, &lt;&lt;An o anglu ngeh ah?&gt;&gt; Neng loong ah ih jat ih rumta heh Teesu ngeh ah. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Eno Jisu ah toonchapkah ano baanlo nyia nyah ah pheekoh rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Jisu tek nawa ngaaksaat lidi erah ih takjom chomui rumta.</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu nyia Pitar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Jen phaksah rum ano, Jisu ih Simon Pitar suh liita, &lt;&lt;Joon sah Simon, wahoh loong ih minchan halang nang ih an ih ehan tam minchan halang?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">&lt;&lt;Minchan ih hala, Teesu,&gt;&gt; Pitar ih ngaak liita, &lt;&lt;an ih jat ih hu ngah ih an minchan ih hala&lt;&lt; ngeh ah.</para>
  <para style="p">Jisu ih Pitar suh baatta, &lt;&lt;Nga saapsah loong ah sokboi uh.&gt;&gt; <verse number="16" style="v"/>Jisu ih Pitar suh taknyi chengta, &lt;&lt;Joon sah Simon, &lt;&lt;ngah an ih minchan nih ehalang?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">“Em Teesu,” “an ih jat ih hu ngah ih an minchan ih hala&lt;&lt; ngeh ah.</para>
  <para style="p">Jisu ih baatta, &lt;&lt;Nga saapsah loong ah sokboi uh.&gt;&gt; <verse number="17" style="v"/>Jisu ih takjom chengta, &lt;&lt;Joon sah Simon, an ih ngah minchan nih ih halang?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">Jisu ih takjom cheng kano Pitar ah thungjoong eta, &lt;&lt;ngah an ih minchan nih ih halang?&gt;&gt; ngeh ih cheng kano ah. Erah raangtaan ih Pitar ih Jisu suh liita, &lt;&lt;Teesu an ih jirep ah jat ih hu; an ih jat ih hu ngah ih an minchan ih hala ngeh ah!”</para>
  <para style="p">Jisu ih Pitar suh baatta, &lt;&lt;Nga saap ah sokboi uh. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ngah ih amiitiit baat hala; an jaaro tokdi mani kaat thung ah erah di katu; enoothong teekaang ang udoh, an lak jaanghaat kuno wahoh ih an thung lahaan ko adoh siitkaat ho.&gt;&gt; <verse number="19" style="v"/>(Arah liiha langla, Jisu ih Pitar ah mamah ti ano Rangte rangka thuk ah erah tiit ah baat ha.) Eno Jisu ih baatta, &lt;&lt;Nga lilih eho!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s">Jisu nyia heliphante wahoh loong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:25">Jn 13:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Pitar lengsok adi heh liko ni heh mongnook warah, japtupta—heh ih phaksat tokdi Jisu reeni tiittong ano chengta warah ah, &lt;&lt;Teesu an mokwaante ah o ang ah?&gt;&gt; <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pitar ih heh ah japtup ano Jisu suh chengta, &lt;&lt;Teesu, erah mih ah mamah ang ah?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Jisu ih Pitar suh liita, &lt;&lt;Erah mih ah ngah maang ngaak raara ething tongthuk ang bah, an raangtaan ih tiimjih ang ah? Nga lilih ih ho!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih kristaan loong laktung ni tiit hu moong ruurangta heliphante erah tatiika tih ngeh ah. Enoothong Jisu ih liimuh; erah mih ah tatiika ngeh ah; Jisu ih amah ba liita, &lt;&lt;Erah mih ah ngah maang ngaak raara ething mok tongthuk ang bah, an raangtaan ih tiimjih ang ah?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Erah jengkhaap jengte ah heliphante dowa wasiit angta, erah raangthiinte ah uh heh angta; eno seng ih jat ehi heh ih baat ha ah amiitiit ah baat ha.</para>
  <para style="s">Hethoon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Amadi uh, Jisu mokah arah jihoh tiit uh rapne ih je ah. Erah loong ah esiit esiit ih mok raangthiinta bah, ngah ih thaakthun angdi erah leedap ah mongrep mina loongtang ih tajen toonpi thengta.</para>
</usx>
